  ('A-jupiter_B-mars_trine', 'synastry', 'in_depth', 'LIVE', 'synastry-aspect', null::date, '{"kind":"interaspect","planetA":"jupiter","planetB":"mars","aspect":"trine"}'::jsonb, ARRAY['A-jupiter_B-mars_trine', 'synastry-jupiter-trine-mars', 'relationship-jupiter-trine-mars']::text[], '{"contentType":"synastry-kb-seed","source":"packages/astro-knowledge","sourcePath":"packages/astro-knowledge/data/synastry/aspects/A-jupiter_B-mars_trine.json","collection":"synastry/aspects","kbId":"A-jupiter_B-mars_trine","importedStatus":"DRAFT"}'::jsonb, 'synastry-kb-v1', null, 'Jupiter Trine Mars', 'This person makes you believe you can do it. Their confidence feeds your drive. Your drive gives their optimism somewhere to go. Together, you tend to move toward things instead of talking yourselves out of them.', 'This person makes you believe you can do it. Their confidence feeds your drive. Your drive gives their optimism somewhere to go. Together, you tend to move toward things instead of talking yourselves out of them. What feels intimidating alone can feel possible together.

You bring out each other''s courage. You back each other''s goals, encourage each other''s risks, and make it easier to trust your own abilities. There is a natural sense of momentum here. Less second-guessing. More doing.

The challenge is that things come so easily between you that you may not push yourselves to use the gift. It feels good to believe in what is possible. It is another thing to actually commit to it.

This connection offers confidence. The invitation is to do something with it. Potential is not the same as movement. Let the encouragement land. Take the step. Trust yourself enough to begin.', '{"sections":[{"heading":"Deep meaning","body":"This person makes you believe you can do it. Their confidence feeds your drive. Your drive gives their optimism somewhere to go. Together, you tend to move toward things instead of talking yourselves out of them. What feels intimidating alone can feel possible together.\n\nYou bring out each other''s courage. You back each other''s goals, encourage each other''s risks, and make it easier to trust your own abilities. There is a natural sense of momentum here. Less second-guessing. More doing.\n\nThe challenge is that things come so easily between you that you may not push yourselves to use the gift. It feels good to believe in what is possible. It is another thing to actually commit to it.\n\nThis connection offers confidence. The invitation is to do something with it. Potential is not the same as movement. Let the encouragement land. Take the step. Trust yourself enough to begin."},{"heading":"Tension","body":"The challenge is that things come so easily between you that you may not push yourselves to use the gift. It feels good to believe in what is possible. It is another thing to actually commit to it."},{"heading":"Advice","body":"This connection offers confidence. The invitation is to do something with it. Potential is not the same as movement. Let the encouragement land. Take the step. Trust yourself enough to begin."}],"synastryKb":{"id":"A-jupiter_B-mars_trine","kind":"interaspect","plainTranslation":"A''s growth meets B''s drive. The trine lets them flow together easily.","summaryDeep":"This person makes you believe you can do it. Their confidence feeds your drive. Your drive gives their optimism somewhere to go. Together, you tend to move toward things instead of talking yourselves out of them. What feels intimidating alone can feel possible together.\n\nYou bring out each other''s courage. You back each other''s goals, encourage each other''s risks, and make it easier to trust your own abilities. There is a natural sense of momentum here. Less second-guessing. More doing.\n\nThe challenge is that things come so easily between you that you may not push yourselves to use the gift. It feels good to believe in what is possible. It is another thing to actually commit to it.\n\nThis connection offers confidence. The invitation is to do something with it. Potential is not the same as movement. Let the encouragement land. Take the step. Trust yourself enough to begin.","tension":"The challenge is that things come so easily between you that you may not push yourselves to use the gift. It feels good to believe in what is possible. It is another thing to actually commit to it.","advice":"This connection offers confidence. The invitation is to do something with it. Potential is not the same as movement. Let the encouragement land. Take the step. Trust yourself enough to begin.","policy":"Governed by synastry-policy. Descriptive, not deterministic; intensity is never treated as obligation, safety concerns override astrology.","note":"Imported from project-authored synastry matrix material. Source file was not copied into the repository.","status":"DRAFT","authoringStatus":"locked","weight":4}}'::jsonb, 'synastry_aspect', 'Seeded from authored synastry KB. summaryShort is preserved as NULL when absent or null.', now()),
  ('A-jupiter_B-mercury_conjunction', 'synastry', 'in_depth', 'LIVE', 'synastry-aspect', null::date, '{"kind":"interaspect","planetA":"jupiter","planetB":"mercury","aspect":"conjunction"}'::jsonb, ARRAY['A-jupiter_B-mercury_conjunction', 'synastry-jupiter-conjunction-mercury', 'relationship-jupiter-conjunction-mercury']::text[], '{"contentType":"synastry-kb-seed","source":"packages/astro-knowledge","sourcePath":"packages/astro-knowledge/data/synastry/aspects/A-jupiter_B-mercury_conjunction.json","collection":"synastry/aspects","kbId":"A-jupiter_B-mercury_conjunction","importedStatus":"DRAFT"}'::jsonb, 'synastry-kb-v1', null, 'Jupiter Conjunction Mercury', null, 'This is the person who reminds you not to think so small. You bring them an idea, a question, a possibility, and somehow it comes back larger. They see opportunities where you see loose ends. They spot potential before there is proof. Their perspective can help you zoom out from the immediate problem and reconnect with the bigger vision of what you are trying to create.

They have a way of helping you see beyond the limits you place on yourself. Through conversation, they broaden your perspective, encourage you to think bigger, and remind you of possibilities you may have overlooked. Around them, your ideas often feel more viable, and your confidence in pursuing them tends to grow.

There is something deeply affirming about being seen this way. Their faith in your potential can help you access more of it. They remind you that your ideas deserve room to develop, that curiosity is worth following, and that ambition is not something you need to apologize for.

The challenge is that inspiration can start to masquerade as progress. A conversation can feel so productive, so exciting, so full of possibility that neither of you notices nothing has actually moved forward yet. The vision expands, but the next step remains undefined.

Take the encouragement. Take the perspective. Then bring it down to earth.', '{"sections":[{"heading":"Deep meaning","body":"This is the person who reminds you not to think so small. You bring them an idea, a question, a possibility, and somehow it comes back larger. They see opportunities where you see loose ends. They spot potential before there is proof. Their perspective can help you zoom out from the immediate problem and reconnect with the bigger vision of what you are trying to create.\n\nThey have a way of helping you see beyond the limits you place on yourself. Through conversation, they broaden your perspective, encourage you to think bigger, and remind you of possibilities you may have overlooked. Around them, your ideas often feel more viable, and your confidence in pursuing them tends to grow.\n\nThere is something deeply affirming about being seen this way. Their faith in your potential can help you access more of it. They remind you that your ideas deserve room to develop, that curiosity is worth following, and that ambition is not something you need to apologize for.\n\nThe challenge is that inspiration can start to masquerade as progress. A conversation can feel so productive, so exciting, so full of possibility that neither of you notices nothing has actually moved forward yet. The vision expands, but the next step remains undefined.\n\nTake the encouragement. Take the perspective. Then bring it down to earth."},{"heading":"Tension","body":"The challenge is that inspiration can start to masquerade as progress. A conversation can feel so productive, so exciting, so full of possibility that neither of you notices nothing has actually moved forward yet. The vision expands, but the next step remains undefined."},{"heading":"Advice","body":"Take the encouragement. Take the perspective. Then bring it down to earth."}],"synastryKb":{"id":"A-jupiter_B-mercury_conjunction","kind":"interaspect","plainTranslation":"A''s growth meets B''s mind. The conjunction fuses them - intense and inseparable.","summaryDeep":"This is the person who reminds you not to think so small. You bring them an idea, a question, a possibility, and somehow it comes back larger. They see opportunities where you see loose ends. They spot potential before there is proof. Their perspective can help you zoom out from the immediate problem and reconnect with the bigger vision of what you are trying to create.\n\nThey have a way of helping you see beyond the limits you place on yourself. Through conversation, they broaden your perspective, encourage you to think bigger, and remind you of possibilities you may have overlooked. Around them, your ideas often feel more viable, and your confidence in pursuing them tends to grow.\n\nThere is something deeply affirming about being seen this way. Their faith in your potential can help you access more of it. They remind you that your ideas deserve room to develop, that curiosity is worth following, and that ambition is not something you need to apologize for.\n\nThe challenge is that inspiration can start to masquerade as progress. A conversation can feel so productive, so exciting, so full of possibility that neither of you notices nothing has actually moved forward yet. The vision expands, but the next step remains undefined.\n\nTake the encouragement. Take the perspective. Then bring it down to earth.","tension":"The challenge is that inspiration can start to masquerade as progress. A conversation can feel so productive, so exciting, so full of possibility that neither of you notices nothing has actually moved forward yet. The vision expands, but the next step remains undefined.","advice":"Take the encouragement. Take the perspective. Then bring it down to earth.","policy":"Governed by synastry-policy. Descriptive, not deterministic; intensity is never treated as obligation, safety concerns override astrology.","note":"Imported from project-authored synastry matrix material. Source file was not copied into the repository.","status":"DRAFT","authoringStatus":"locked","weight":4}}'::jsonb, 'synastry_aspect', 'Seeded from authored synastry KB. summaryShort is preserved as NULL when absent or null.', now()),
  ('A-jupiter_B-mercury_opposition', 'synastry', 'in_depth', 'LIVE', 'synastry-aspect', null::date, '{"kind":"interaspect","planetA":"jupiter","planetB":"mercury","aspect":"opposition"}'::jsonb, ARRAY['A-jupiter_B-mercury_opposition', 'synastry-jupiter-opposition-mercury', 'relationship-jupiter-opposition-mercury']::text[], '{"contentType":"synastry-kb-seed","source":"packages/astro-knowledge","sourcePath":"packages/astro-knowledge/data/synastry/aspects/A-jupiter_B-mercury_opposition.json","collection":"synastry/aspects","kbId":"A-jupiter_B-mercury_opposition","importedStatus":"DRAFT"}'::jsonb, 'synastry-kb-v1', null, 'Jupiter Opposition Mercury', null, 'This person often challenges the scale of your thinking.

You may approach a situation by looking at what is practical, immediate, or supported by the facts in front of you, while they are more interested in where things could lead or what larger meaning might be unfolding. Conversations between you can stretch your perspective, even when you do not agree. Sometimes their outlook feels inspiring and helps you see beyond your usual assumptions. Other times, it can seem like they are overlooking important details in favor of a bigger vision.

This connection works best when you combine those different strengths. They broaden the conversation and help you consider possibilities you might not have explored, while you bring focus and help identify what is actually workable. Together, you can balance vision with practicality.

When the tension rises, both of you can become attached to your own version of the truth. They may experience you as limiting or overly cautious. You may experience them as disconnected from what is actually possible. The gift of this aspect is perspective, but under stress, perspective can harden into certainty, and certainty leaves little room to learn from one another.

The invitation here is to stop treating the difference as a problem to solve. Their perspective can open doors you would never have considered, while your judgment keeps those possibilities connected to reality. Neither view is enough on its own. The real strength of this connection comes when vision and discernment work together, turning possibility into a roadmap you can actually follow.', '{"sections":[{"heading":"Deep meaning","body":"This person often challenges the scale of your thinking.\n\nYou may approach a situation by looking at what is practical, immediate, or supported by the facts in front of you, while they are more interested in where things could lead or what larger meaning might be unfolding. Conversations between you can stretch your perspective, even when you do not agree. Sometimes their outlook feels inspiring and helps you see beyond your usual assumptions. Other times, it can seem like they are overlooking important details in favor of a bigger vision.\n\nThis connection works best when you combine those different strengths. They broaden the conversation and help you consider possibilities you might not have explored, while you bring focus and help identify what is actually workable. Together, you can balance vision with practicality.\n\nWhen the tension rises, both of you can become attached to your own version of the truth. They may experience you as limiting or overly cautious. You may experience them as disconnected from what is actually possible. The gift of this aspect is perspective, but under stress, perspective can harden into certainty, and certainty leaves little room to learn from one another.\n\nThe invitation here is to stop treating the difference as a problem to solve. Their perspective can open doors you would never have considered, while your judgment keeps those possibilities connected to reality. Neither view is enough on its own. The real strength of this connection comes when vision and discernment work together, turning possibility into a roadmap you can actually follow."},{"heading":"Tension","body":"When the tension rises, both of you can become attached to your own version of the truth. They may experience you as limiting or overly cautious. You may experience them as disconnected from what is actually possible. The gift of this aspect is perspective, but under stress, perspective can harden into certainty, and certainty leaves little room to learn from one another."},{"heading":"Advice","body":"The invitation here is to stop treating the difference as a problem to solve. Their perspective can open doors you would never have considered, while your judgment keeps those possibilities connected to reality. Neither view is enough on its own. The real strength of this connection comes when vision and discernment work together, turning possibility into a roadmap you can actually follow."}],"synastryKb":{"id":"A-jupiter_B-mercury_opposition","kind":"interaspect","plainTranslation":"A''s growth meets B''s mind. The opposition pulls them into push-and-pull.","summaryDeep":"This person often challenges the scale of your thinking.\n\nYou may approach a situation by looking at what is practical, immediate, or supported by the facts in front of you, while they are more interested in where things could lead or what larger meaning might be unfolding. Conversations between you can stretch your perspective, even when you do not agree. Sometimes their outlook feels inspiring and helps you see beyond your usual assumptions. Other times, it can seem like they are overlooking important details in favor of a bigger vision.\n\nThis connection works best when you combine those different strengths. They broaden the conversation and help you consider possibilities you might not have explored, while you bring focus and help identify what is actually workable. Together, you can balance vision with practicality.\n\nWhen the tension rises, both of you can become attached to your own version of the truth. They may experience you as limiting or overly cautious. You may experience them as disconnected from what is actually possible. The gift of this aspect is perspective, but under stress, perspective can harden into certainty, and certainty leaves little room to learn from one another.\n\nThe invitation here is to stop treating the difference as a problem to solve. Their perspective can open doors you would never have considered, while your judgment keeps those possibilities connected to reality. Neither view is enough on its own. The real strength of this connection comes when vision and discernment work together, turning possibility into a roadmap you can actually follow.","tension":"When the tension rises, both of you can become attached to your own version of the truth. They may experience you as limiting or overly cautious. You may experience them as disconnected from what is actually possible. The gift of this aspect is perspective, but under stress, perspective can harden into certainty, and certainty leaves little room to learn from one another.","advice":"The invitation here is to stop treating the difference as a problem to solve. Their perspective can open doors you would never have considered, while your judgment keeps those possibilities connected to reality. Neither view is enough on its own. The real strength of this connection comes when vision and discernment work together, turning possibility into a roadmap you can actually follow.","policy":"Governed by synastry-policy. Descriptive, not deterministic; intensity is never treated as obligation, safety concerns override astrology.","note":"Imported from project-authored synastry matrix material. Source file was not copied into the repository.","status":"DRAFT","authoringStatus":"locked","weight":4}}'::jsonb, 'synastry_aspect', 'Seeded from authored synastry KB. summaryShort is preserved as NULL when absent or null.', now()),
  ('A-jupiter_B-mercury_sextile', 'synastry', 'in_depth', 'LIVE', 'synastry-aspect', null::date, '{"kind":"interaspect","planetA":"jupiter","planetB":"mercury","aspect":"sextile"}'::jsonb, ARRAY['A-jupiter_B-mercury_sextile', 'synastry-jupiter-sextile-mercury', 'relationship-jupiter-sextile-mercury']::text[], '{"contentType":"synastry-kb-seed","source":"packages/astro-knowledge","sourcePath":"packages/astro-knowledge/data/synastry/aspects/A-jupiter_B-mercury_sextile.json","collection":"synastry/aspects","kbId":"A-jupiter_B-mercury_sextile","importedStatus":"DRAFT"}'::jsonb, 'synastry-kb-v1', null, 'Jupiter Sextile Mercury', null, 'This person helps you see more than you can see on your own.

They help you see more possibility in what you are thinking about. An idea, question, or decision often feels clearer and more expansive after you talk to them.

The gift of this connection is perspective. This person reminds you not to limit yourself too quickly. They encourage possibility, but they do it in a way that helps you think more deeply, not just more positively.

The challenge is that this connection asks for participation. Its gifts tend to appear in the exchange itself. If you keep your thoughts tucked away until they are fully formed, you may never discover what this person could have helped you uncover.

Let them into the process before you have all the answers. Share the unfinished version. Sometimes their perspective reveals a path you could not have found alone.', '{"sections":[{"heading":"Deep meaning","body":"This person helps you see more than you can see on your own.\n\nThey help you see more possibility in what you are thinking about. An idea, question, or decision often feels clearer and more expansive after you talk to them.\n\nThe gift of this connection is perspective. This person reminds you not to limit yourself too quickly. They encourage possibility, but they do it in a way that helps you think more deeply, not just more positively.\n\nThe challenge is that this connection asks for participation. Its gifts tend to appear in the exchange itself. If you keep your thoughts tucked away until they are fully formed, you may never discover what this person could have helped you uncover.\n\nLet them into the process before you have all the answers. Share the unfinished version. Sometimes their perspective reveals a path you could not have found alone."},{"heading":"Tension","body":"The challenge is that this connection asks for participation. Its gifts tend to appear in the exchange itself. If you keep your thoughts tucked away until they are fully formed, you may never discover what this person could have helped you uncover."},{"heading":"Advice","body":"Let them into the process before you have all the answers. Share the unfinished version. Sometimes their perspective reveals a path you could not have found alone."}],"synastryKb":{"id":"A-jupiter_B-mercury_sextile","kind":"interaspect","plainTranslation":"A''s growth meets B''s mind. The sextile supports them, if you act on it.","summaryDeep":"This person helps you see more than you can see on your own.\n\nThey help you see more possibility in what you are thinking about. An idea, question, or decision often feels clearer and more expansive after you talk to them.\n\nThe gift of this connection is perspective. This person reminds you not to limit yourself too quickly. They encourage possibility, but they do it in a way that helps you think more deeply, not just more positively.\n\nThe challenge is that this connection asks for participation. Its gifts tend to appear in the exchange itself. If you keep your thoughts tucked away until they are fully formed, you may never discover what this person could have helped you uncover.\n\nLet them into the process before you have all the answers. Share the unfinished version. Sometimes their perspective reveals a path you could not have found alone.","tension":"The challenge is that this connection asks for participation. Its gifts tend to appear in the exchange itself. If you keep your thoughts tucked away until they are fully formed, you may never discover what this person could have helped you uncover.","advice":"Let them into the process before you have all the answers. Share the unfinished version. Sometimes their perspective reveals a path you could not have found alone.","policy":"Governed by synastry-policy. Descriptive, not deterministic; intensity is never treated as obligation, safety concerns override astrology.","note":"Imported from project-authored synastry matrix material. Source file was not copied into the repository.","status":"DRAFT","authoringStatus":"locked","weight":4}}'::jsonb, 'synastry_aspect', 'Seeded from authored synastry KB. summaryShort is preserved as NULL when absent or null.', now()),
  ('A-jupiter_B-mercury_square', 'synastry', 'in_depth', 'LIVE', 'synastry-aspect', null::date, '{"kind":"interaspect","planetA":"jupiter","planetB":"mercury","aspect":"square"}'::jsonb, ARRAY['A-jupiter_B-mercury_square', 'synastry-jupiter-square-mercury', 'relationship-jupiter-square-mercury']::text[], '{"contentType":"synastry-kb-seed","source":"packages/astro-knowledge","sourcePath":"packages/astro-knowledge/data/synastry/aspects/A-jupiter_B-mercury_square.json","collection":"synastry/aspects","kbId":"A-jupiter_B-mercury_square","importedStatus":"DRAFT"}'::jsonb, 'synastry-kb-v1', null, 'Jupiter Square Mercury', null, 'This person has a way of stretching your thinking past its comfort zone.

They may see opportunity where you see risk, possibility where you see unanswered questions. Their instinct is often to go bigger, faster, further. At times, that can feel inspiring. At other times, it can feel like they are skipping over the practical realities that matter to you.

This connection often highlights the tension between vision and discernment. They may challenge assumptions you did not realize you were carrying. They may push against limits that have become so familiar you mistake them for facts. Around them, you may discover that some of your caution comes from wisdom, while some of it comes from fear.

When this dynamic is working well, they help you expand your sense of what is possible. They encourage you to think beyond the version of the story you have already accepted. They remind you that growth rarely happens inside the boundaries of certainty.

The challenge is separating real possibility from wishful thinking. They tend to expand. You tend to question. If you are not careful, one person becomes the visionary and the other becomes the skeptic.

At its best, this connection creates balance. They help you see beyond your usual limits, and you help turn possibility into something workable. Their vision gives the idea room to grow. Your discernment helps it take shape.', '{"sections":[{"heading":"Deep meaning","body":"This person has a way of stretching your thinking past its comfort zone.\n\nThey may see opportunity where you see risk, possibility where you see unanswered questions. Their instinct is often to go bigger, faster, further. At times, that can feel inspiring. At other times, it can feel like they are skipping over the practical realities that matter to you.\n\nThis connection often highlights the tension between vision and discernment. They may challenge assumptions you did not realize you were carrying. They may push against limits that have become so familiar you mistake them for facts. Around them, you may discover that some of your caution comes from wisdom, while some of it comes from fear.\n\nWhen this dynamic is working well, they help you expand your sense of what is possible. They encourage you to think beyond the version of the story you have already accepted. They remind you that growth rarely happens inside the boundaries of certainty.\n\nThe challenge is separating real possibility from wishful thinking. They tend to expand. You tend to question. If you are not careful, one person becomes the visionary and the other becomes the skeptic.\n\nAt its best, this connection creates balance. They help you see beyond your usual limits, and you help turn possibility into something workable. Their vision gives the idea room to grow. Your discernment helps it take shape."},{"heading":"Tension","body":"The challenge is separating real possibility from wishful thinking. They tend to expand. You tend to question. If you are not careful, one person becomes the visionary and the other becomes the skeptic."},{"heading":"Advice","body":"At its best, this connection creates balance. They help you see beyond your usual limits, and you help turn possibility into something workable. Their vision gives the idea room to grow. Your discernment helps it take shape."}],"synastryKb":{"id":"A-jupiter_B-mercury_square","kind":"interaspect","plainTranslation":"A''s growth meets B''s mind. The square puts them in friction.","summaryDeep":"This person has a way of stretching your thinking past its comfort zone.\n\nThey may see opportunity where you see risk, possibility where you see unanswered questions. Their instinct is often to go bigger, faster, further. At times, that can feel inspiring. At other times, it can feel like they are skipping over the practical realities that matter to you.\n\nThis connection often highlights the tension between vision and discernment. They may challenge assumptions you did not realize you were carrying. They may push against limits that have become so familiar you mistake them for facts. Around them, you may discover that some of your caution comes from wisdom, while some of it comes from fear.\n\nWhen this dynamic is working well, they help you expand your sense of what is possible. They encourage you to think beyond the version of the story you have already accepted. They remind you that growth rarely happens inside the boundaries of certainty.\n\nThe challenge is separating real possibility from wishful thinking. They tend to expand. You tend to question. If you are not careful, one person becomes the visionary and the other becomes the skeptic.\n\nAt its best, this connection creates balance. They help you see beyond your usual limits, and you help turn possibility into something workable. Their vision gives the idea room to grow. Your discernment helps it take shape.","tension":"The challenge is separating real possibility from wishful thinking. They tend to expand. You tend to question. If you are not careful, one person becomes the visionary and the other becomes the skeptic.","advice":"At its best, this connection creates balance. They help you see beyond your usual limits, and you help turn possibility into something workable. Their vision gives the idea room to grow. Your discernment helps it take shape.","policy":"Governed by synastry-policy. Descriptive, not deterministic; intensity is never treated as obligation, safety concerns override astrology.","note":"Imported from project-authored synastry matrix material. Source file was not copied into the repository.","status":"DRAFT","authoringStatus":"locked","weight":4}}'::jsonb, 'synastry_aspect', 'Seeded from authored synastry KB. summaryShort is preserved as NULL when absent or null.', now()),
  ('A-jupiter_B-mercury_trine', 'synastry', 'in_depth', 'LIVE', 'synastry-aspect', null::date, '{"kind":"interaspect","planetA":"jupiter","planetB":"mercury","aspect":"trine"}'::jsonb, ARRAY['A-jupiter_B-mercury_trine', 'synastry-jupiter-trine-mercury', 'relationship-jupiter-trine-mercury']::text[], '{"contentType":"synastry-kb-seed","source":"packages/astro-knowledge","sourcePath":"packages/astro-knowledge/data/synastry/aspects/A-jupiter_B-mercury_trine.json","collection":"synastry/aspects","kbId":"A-jupiter_B-mercury_trine","importedStatus":"DRAFT"}'::jsonb, 'synastry-kb-v1', null, 'Jupiter Trine Mercury', null, 'This is the person who reminds you of your potential when you forget it.

Talking with them tends to pull you out of whatever narrow frame you''ve been stuck in. You might bring up a problem or an idea you''re trying to make sense of, and somehow the conversation leaves you seeing more room to move than you did before. They have a way of reminding you that there is a bigger context, a larger story, or another path forward, and that shift in perspective can make you feel more confident about where you''re headed.

At its best, this is a relationship that supports growth. They encourage your ideas in a way that helps you believe in them more fully. When you lose sight of your progress, they remind you how far you have come and what you are working toward. They have a knack for placing today''s challenges within a larger context, helping you see meaning and possibility where you might otherwise focus only on the immediate problem. Their support feels empowering because they broaden your perspective while still leaving the decisions and direction in your hands.

This person helps you see the bigger picture when you''ve gotten stuck in doubt, details, or fear.

The challenge is not settling for inspiration by itself. It can feel rewarding to explore ideas together, imagine different futures, and get excited about what might be possible. But possibility only becomes meaningful when something is done with it. What makes this connection valuable is its ability to turn broad thinking into real direction, helping ideas move beyond discussion and into something tangible.

Take what gets illuminated between you and put it to use. Let the conversation become a choice, a direction, a next step. The wisdom here grows when possibility is given somewhere real to land.', '{"sections":[{"heading":"Deep meaning","body":"This is the person who reminds you of your potential when you forget it.\n\nTalking with them tends to pull you out of whatever narrow frame you''ve been stuck in. You might bring up a problem or an idea you''re trying to make sense of, and somehow the conversation leaves you seeing more room to move than you did before. They have a way of reminding you that there is a bigger context, a larger story, or another path forward, and that shift in perspective can make you feel more confident about where you''re headed.\n\nAt its best, this is a relationship that supports growth. They encourage your ideas in a way that helps you believe in them more fully. When you lose sight of your progress, they remind you how far you have come and what you are working toward. They have a knack for placing today''s challenges within a larger context, helping you see meaning and possibility where you might otherwise focus only on the immediate problem. Their support feels empowering because they broaden your perspective while still leaving the decisions and direction in your hands.\n\nThis person helps you see the bigger picture when you''ve gotten stuck in doubt, details, or fear.\n\nThe challenge is not settling for inspiration by itself. It can feel rewarding to explore ideas together, imagine different futures, and get excited about what might be possible. But possibility only becomes meaningful when something is done with it. What makes this connection valuable is its ability to turn broad thinking into real direction, helping ideas move beyond discussion and into something tangible.\n\nTake what gets illuminated between you and put it to use. Let the conversation become a choice, a direction, a next step. The wisdom here grows when possibility is given somewhere real to land."},{"heading":"Tension","body":"The challenge is not settling for inspiration by itself. It can feel rewarding to explore ideas together, imagine different futures, and get excited about what might be possible. But possibility only becomes meaningful when something is done with it. What makes this connection valuable is its ability to turn broad thinking into real direction, helping ideas move beyond discussion and into something tangible."},{"heading":"Advice","body":"Take what gets illuminated between you and put it to use. Let the conversation become a choice, a direction, a next step. The wisdom here grows when possibility is given somewhere real to land."}],"synastryKb":{"id":"A-jupiter_B-mercury_trine","kind":"interaspect","plainTranslation":"A''s growth meets B''s mind. The trine lets them flow together easily.","summaryDeep":"This is the person who reminds you of your potential when you forget it.\n\nTalking with them tends to pull you out of whatever narrow frame you''ve been stuck in. You might bring up a problem or an idea you''re trying to make sense of, and somehow the conversation leaves you seeing more room to move than you did before. They have a way of reminding you that there is a bigger context, a larger story, or another path forward, and that shift in perspective can make you feel more confident about where you''re headed.\n\nAt its best, this is a relationship that supports growth. They encourage your ideas in a way that helps you believe in them more fully. When you lose sight of your progress, they remind you how far you have come and what you are working toward. They have a knack for placing today''s challenges within a larger context, helping you see meaning and possibility where you might otherwise focus only on the immediate problem. Their support feels empowering because they broaden your perspective while still leaving the decisions and direction in your hands.\n\nThis person helps you see the bigger picture when you''ve gotten stuck in doubt, details, or fear.\n\nThe challenge is not settling for inspiration by itself. It can feel rewarding to explore ideas together, imagine different futures, and get excited about what might be possible. But possibility only becomes meaningful when something is done with it. What makes this connection valuable is its ability to turn broad thinking into real direction, helping ideas move beyond discussion and into something tangible.\n\nTake what gets illuminated between you and put it to use. Let the conversation become a choice, a direction, a next step. The wisdom here grows when possibility is given somewhere real to land.","tension":"The challenge is not settling for inspiration by itself. It can feel rewarding to explore ideas together, imagine different futures, and get excited about what might be possible. But possibility only becomes meaningful when something is done with it. What makes this connection valuable is its ability to turn broad thinking into real direction, helping ideas move beyond discussion and into something tangible.","advice":"Take what gets illuminated between you and put it to use. Let the conversation become a choice, a direction, a next step. The wisdom here grows when possibility is given somewhere real to land.","policy":"Governed by synastry-policy. Descriptive, not deterministic; intensity is never treated as obligation, safety concerns override astrology.","note":"Imported from project-authored synastry matrix material. Source file was not copied into the repository.","status":"DRAFT","authoringStatus":"locked","weight":4}}'::jsonb, 'synastry_aspect', 'Seeded from authored synastry KB. summaryShort is preserved as NULL when absent or null.', now()),
  ('A-jupiter_B-moon_conjunction', 'synastry', 'in_depth', 'LIVE', 'synastry-aspect', null::date, '{"kind":"interaspect","planetA":"jupiter","planetB":"moon","aspect":"conjunction"}'::jsonb, ARRAY['A-jupiter_B-moon_conjunction', 'synastry-jupiter-conjunction-moon', 'relationship-jupiter-conjunction-moon']::text[], '{"contentType":"synastry-kb-seed","source":"packages/astro-knowledge","sourcePath":"packages/astro-knowledge/data/synastry/aspects/A-jupiter_B-moon_conjunction.json","collection":"synastry/aspects","kbId":"A-jupiter_B-moon_conjunction","importedStatus":"DRAFT"}'::jsonb, 'synastry-kb-v1', null, 'Jupiter Conjunction Moon', null, 'This person has a way of reminding you that your feelings deserve room to exist.

Their care can feel abundant. Their instinct is often to meet your emotions with generosity rather than judgment, encouragement rather than criticism. Around them it may feel easier to believe that what you are carrying does not have to be carried alone.

This person makes it easier to be yourself. Their response to your feelings is usually support, not judgment, so opening up feels safer than it does with most people. When life is hard, they remind you that you do not have to carry it alone. When life is good, they are genuinely happy for you. Around them, it is easier to trust your own feelings, ask for what you need, and believe that things can get better.

One thing to watch for is using comfort to avoid the truth. You may rush to make each other feel better instead of staying with what the feeling is trying to tell you.

Take the support. Face the problem anyway. This connection is strongest when the encouragement helps you deal with hard things instead of avoiding them.', '{"sections":[{"heading":"Deep meaning","body":"This person has a way of reminding you that your feelings deserve room to exist.\n\nTheir care can feel abundant. Their instinct is often to meet your emotions with generosity rather than judgment, encouragement rather than criticism. Around them it may feel easier to believe that what you are carrying does not have to be carried alone.\n\nThis person makes it easier to be yourself. Their response to your feelings is usually support, not judgment, so opening up feels safer than it does with most people. When life is hard, they remind you that you do not have to carry it alone. When life is good, they are genuinely happy for you. Around them, it is easier to trust your own feelings, ask for what you need, and believe that things can get better.\n\nOne thing to watch for is using comfort to avoid the truth. You may rush to make each other feel better instead of staying with what the feeling is trying to tell you.\n\nTake the support. Face the problem anyway. This connection is strongest when the encouragement helps you deal with hard things instead of avoiding them."},{"heading":"Tension","body":"One thing to watch for is using comfort to avoid the truth. You may rush to make each other feel better instead of staying with what the feeling is trying to tell you."},{"heading":"Advice","body":"Take the support. Face the problem anyway. This connection is strongest when the encouragement helps you deal with hard things instead of avoiding them."}],"synastryKb":{"id":"A-jupiter_B-moon_conjunction","kind":"interaspect","plainTranslation":"A''s growth meets B''s feelings. The conjunction fuses them - intense and inseparable.","summaryDeep":"This person has a way of reminding you that your feelings deserve room to exist.\n\nTheir care can feel abundant. Their instinct is often to meet your emotions with generosity rather than judgment, encouragement rather than criticism. Around them it may feel easier to believe that what you are carrying does not have to be carried alone.\n\nThis person makes it easier to be yourself. Their response to your feelings is usually support, not judgment, so opening up feels safer than it does with most people. When life is hard, they remind you that you do not have to carry it alone. When life is good, they are genuinely happy for you. Around them, it is easier to trust your own feelings, ask for what you need, and believe that things can get better.\n\nOne thing to watch for is using comfort to avoid the truth. You may rush to make each other feel better instead of staying with what the feeling is trying to tell you.\n\nTake the support. Face the problem anyway. This connection is strongest when the encouragement helps you deal with hard things instead of avoiding them.","tension":"One thing to watch for is using comfort to avoid the truth. You may rush to make each other feel better instead of staying with what the feeling is trying to tell you.","advice":"Take the support. Face the problem anyway. This connection is strongest when the encouragement helps you deal with hard things instead of avoiding them.","policy":"Governed by synastry-policy. Descriptive, not deterministic; intensity is never treated as obligation, safety concerns override astrology.","note":"Imported from project-authored synastry matrix material. Source file was not copied into the repository.","status":"DRAFT","authoringStatus":"locked","weight":4}}'::jsonb, 'synastry_aspect', 'Seeded from authored synastry KB. summaryShort is preserved as NULL when absent or null.', now()),
  ('A-jupiter_B-moon_opposition', 'synastry', 'in_depth', 'LIVE', 'synastry-aspect', null::date, '{"kind":"interaspect","planetA":"jupiter","planetB":"moon","aspect":"opposition"}'::jsonb, ARRAY['A-jupiter_B-moon_opposition', 'synastry-jupiter-opposition-moon', 'relationship-jupiter-opposition-moon']::text[], '{"contentType":"synastry-kb-seed","source":"packages/astro-knowledge","sourcePath":"packages/astro-knowledge/data/synastry/aspects/A-jupiter_B-moon_opposition.json","collection":"synastry/aspects","kbId":"A-jupiter_B-moon_opposition","importedStatus":"DRAFT"}'::jsonb, 'synastry-kb-v1', null, 'Jupiter Opposition Moon', null, 'This person gives emotional warmth freely, and sometimes it feels like more than you want.

They often respond to your feelings with encouragement, reassurance, or a desire to help. While their intentions are genuine, there may be moments when you feel like they are trying to move you past an emotion before you have had the chance to fully experience it. What feels supportive to them can sometimes leave you feeling unseen.

At its best, this connection teaches both of you something important. They remind you that you do not have to carry everything alone, and that support can be offered freely. You remind them that some feelings need to be witnessed before they can be healed. Not every difficult moment needs a solution right away.

They offer comfort when you want understanding, and they feel rejected when their care does not land. Neither of you is wrong. You are speaking different emotional languages.

Say what you need. Let their warmth in without letting it override your experience.', '{"sections":[{"heading":"Deep meaning","body":"This person gives emotional warmth freely, and sometimes it feels like more than you want.\n\nThey often respond to your feelings with encouragement, reassurance, or a desire to help. While their intentions are genuine, there may be moments when you feel like they are trying to move you past an emotion before you have had the chance to fully experience it. What feels supportive to them can sometimes leave you feeling unseen.\n\nAt its best, this connection teaches both of you something important. They remind you that you do not have to carry everything alone, and that support can be offered freely. You remind them that some feelings need to be witnessed before they can be healed. Not every difficult moment needs a solution right away.\n\nThey offer comfort when you want understanding, and they feel rejected when their care does not land. Neither of you is wrong. You are speaking different emotional languages.\n\nSay what you need. Let their warmth in without letting it override your experience."},{"heading":"Tension","body":"They offer comfort when you want understanding, and they feel rejected when their care does not land. Neither of you is wrong. You are speaking different emotional languages."},{"heading":"Advice","body":"Say what you need. Let their warmth in without letting it override your experience."}],"synastryKb":{"id":"A-jupiter_B-moon_opposition","kind":"interaspect","plainTranslation":"A''s growth meets B''s feelings. The opposition pulls them into push-and-pull.","summaryDeep":"This person gives emotional warmth freely, and sometimes it feels like more than you want.\n\nThey often respond to your feelings with encouragement, reassurance, or a desire to help. While their intentions are genuine, there may be moments when you feel like they are trying to move you past an emotion before you have had the chance to fully experience it. What feels supportive to them can sometimes leave you feeling unseen.\n\nAt its best, this connection teaches both of you something important. They remind you that you do not have to carry everything alone, and that support can be offered freely. You remind them that some feelings need to be witnessed before they can be healed. Not every difficult moment needs a solution right away.\n\nThey offer comfort when you want understanding, and they feel rejected when their care does not land. Neither of you is wrong. You are speaking different emotional languages.\n\nSay what you need. Let their warmth in without letting it override your experience.","tension":"They offer comfort when you want understanding, and they feel rejected when their care does not land. Neither of you is wrong. You are speaking different emotional languages.","advice":"Say what you need. Let their warmth in without letting it override your experience.","policy":"Governed by synastry-policy. Descriptive, not deterministic; intensity is never treated as obligation, safety concerns override astrology.","note":"Imported from project-authored synastry matrix material. Source file was not copied into the repository.","status":"DRAFT","authoringStatus":"locked","weight":4}}'::jsonb, 'synastry_aspect', 'Seeded from authored synastry KB. summaryShort is preserved as NULL when absent or null.', now()),
  ('A-jupiter_B-moon_sextile', 'synastry', 'in_depth', 'LIVE', 'synastry-aspect', null::date, '{"kind":"interaspect","planetA":"jupiter","planetB":"moon","aspect":"sextile"}'::jsonb, ARRAY['A-jupiter_B-moon_sextile', 'synastry-jupiter-sextile-moon', 'relationship-jupiter-sextile-moon']::text[], '{"contentType":"synastry-kb-seed","source":"packages/astro-knowledge","sourcePath":"packages/astro-knowledge/data/synastry/aspects/A-jupiter_B-moon_sextile.json","collection":"synastry/aspects","kbId":"A-jupiter_B-moon_sextile","importedStatus":"DRAFT"}'::jsonb, 'synastry-kb-v1', null, 'Jupiter Sextile Moon', null, 'Support in this connection grows when you actually let each other in.

There''s a natural sense of goodwill here. This person wants good things for you, and you probably want the same for them. But the closeness doesn''t happen automatically. It builds little by little, every time you share something real and find that it''s met with care instead of judgment.

What makes this connection special isn''t some huge emotional breakthrough. It''s the small stuff. Feeling listened to. Feeling remembered. Knowing someone notices when you''re having a hard time. Realizing you don''t have to handle everything on your own.

Because the support is gentle rather than overwhelming, it''s easy to miss. You might assume they know what''s going on without ever saying it. You might keep things to yourself until you''re already struggling, then wonder why the connection doesn''t feel as supportive as it could.

The more you let this person be part of your emotional world, the stronger the bond becomes. The more honest you are about what''s going on, the more room there is for real support. What starts as simple kindness can grow into something deeply comforting and reliable over time.', '{"sections":[{"heading":"Deep meaning","body":"Support in this connection grows when you actually let each other in.\n\nThere''s a natural sense of goodwill here. This person wants good things for you, and you probably want the same for them. But the closeness doesn''t happen automatically. It builds little by little, every time you share something real and find that it''s met with care instead of judgment.\n\nWhat makes this connection special isn''t some huge emotional breakthrough. It''s the small stuff. Feeling listened to. Feeling remembered. Knowing someone notices when you''re having a hard time. Realizing you don''t have to handle everything on your own.\n\nBecause the support is gentle rather than overwhelming, it''s easy to miss. You might assume they know what''s going on without ever saying it. You might keep things to yourself until you''re already struggling, then wonder why the connection doesn''t feel as supportive as it could.\n\nThe more you let this person be part of your emotional world, the stronger the bond becomes. The more honest you are about what''s going on, the more room there is for real support. What starts as simple kindness can grow into something deeply comforting and reliable over time."},{"heading":"Tension","body":"Because the support is gentle rather than overwhelming, it''s easy to miss. You might assume they know what''s going on without ever saying it. You might keep things to yourself until you''re already struggling, then wonder why the connection doesn''t feel as supportive as it could."},{"heading":"Advice","body":"The more you let this person be part of your emotional world, the stronger the bond becomes. The more honest you are about what''s going on, the more room there is for real support. What starts as simple kindness can grow into something deeply comforting and reliable over time."}],"synastryKb":{"id":"A-jupiter_B-moon_sextile","kind":"interaspect","plainTranslation":"A''s growth meets B''s feelings. The sextile supports them, if you act on it.","summaryDeep":"Support in this connection grows when you actually let each other in.\n\nThere''s a natural sense of goodwill here. This person wants good things for you, and you probably want the same for them. But the closeness doesn''t happen automatically. It builds little by little, every time you share something real and find that it''s met with care instead of judgment.\n\nWhat makes this connection special isn''t some huge emotional breakthrough. It''s the small stuff. Feeling listened to. Feeling remembered. Knowing someone notices when you''re having a hard time. Realizing you don''t have to handle everything on your own.\n\nBecause the support is gentle rather than overwhelming, it''s easy to miss. You might assume they know what''s going on without ever saying it. You might keep things to yourself until you''re already struggling, then wonder why the connection doesn''t feel as supportive as it could.\n\nThe more you let this person be part of your emotional world, the stronger the bond becomes. The more honest you are about what''s going on, the more room there is for real support. What starts as simple kindness can grow into something deeply comforting and reliable over time.","tension":"Because the support is gentle rather than overwhelming, it''s easy to miss. You might assume they know what''s going on without ever saying it. You might keep things to yourself until you''re already struggling, then wonder why the connection doesn''t feel as supportive as it could.","advice":"The more you let this person be part of your emotional world, the stronger the bond becomes. The more honest you are about what''s going on, the more room there is for real support. What starts as simple kindness can grow into something deeply comforting and reliable over time.","policy":"Governed by synastry-policy. Descriptive, not deterministic; intensity is never treated as obligation, safety concerns override astrology.","note":"Imported from project-authored synastry matrix material. Source file was not copied into the repository.","status":"DRAFT","authoringStatus":"locked","weight":4}}'::jsonb, 'synastry_aspect', 'Seeded from authored synastry KB. summaryShort is preserved as NULL when absent or null.', now()),
  ('A-jupiter_B-moon_square', 'synastry', 'in_depth', 'LIVE', 'synastry-aspect', null::date, '{"kind":"interaspect","planetA":"jupiter","planetB":"moon","aspect":"square"}'::jsonb, ARRAY['A-jupiter_B-moon_square', 'synastry-jupiter-square-moon', 'relationship-jupiter-square-moon']::text[], '{"contentType":"synastry-kb-seed","source":"packages/astro-knowledge","sourcePath":"packages/astro-knowledge/data/synastry/aspects/A-jupiter_B-moon_square.json","collection":"synastry/aspects","kbId":"A-jupiter_B-moon_square","importedStatus":"DRAFT"}'::jsonb, 'synastry-kb-v1', null, 'Jupiter Square Moon', null, 'This person cares about how you feel, but they do not always know how to be with your feelings.

When you are hurting, they often respond by trying to make the pain feel lighter. Their care comes through reassurance, perspective, and a belief that things can improve. Even when their intentions are good, you may sometimes feel rushed past what you are actually experiencing. What you need in those moments is not a brighter outlook but the feeling that someone truly understands where you are before trying to fix it.

That can be a lonely feeling. You may know they care about you and still feel like something important got missed. You leave the interaction feeling comforted on the surface, but the deeper part of your experience remains untouched. Their optimism can feel reassuring when you need hope and frustrating when you need understanding.

At its best, this connection helps you carry your feelings without getting lost in them. They remind you that what hurts right now is not the whole story. When you feel overwhelmed, they bring perspective, helping you step back from the emotion without dismissing it and remember that there is still room for hope.

The challenge is making room for both truth and comfort. If every difficult feeling gets softened too quickly, important emotions get skipped over. If every attempt at reassurance is rejected, genuine care goes unnoticed.

The more you can meet in the middle, the more supported and understood you both feel.', '{"sections":[{"heading":"Deep meaning","body":"This person cares about how you feel, but they do not always know how to be with your feelings.\n\nWhen you are hurting, they often respond by trying to make the pain feel lighter. Their care comes through reassurance, perspective, and a belief that things can improve. Even when their intentions are good, you may sometimes feel rushed past what you are actually experiencing. What you need in those moments is not a brighter outlook but the feeling that someone truly understands where you are before trying to fix it.\n\nThat can be a lonely feeling. You may know they care about you and still feel like something important got missed. You leave the interaction feeling comforted on the surface, but the deeper part of your experience remains untouched. Their optimism can feel reassuring when you need hope and frustrating when you need understanding.\n\nAt its best, this connection helps you carry your feelings without getting lost in them. They remind you that what hurts right now is not the whole story. When you feel overwhelmed, they bring perspective, helping you step back from the emotion without dismissing it and remember that there is still room for hope.\n\nThe challenge is making room for both truth and comfort. If every difficult feeling gets softened too quickly, important emotions get skipped over. If every attempt at reassurance is rejected, genuine care goes unnoticed.\n\nThe more you can meet in the middle, the more supported and understood you both feel."},{"heading":"Tension","body":"The challenge is making room for both truth and comfort. If every difficult feeling gets softened too quickly, important emotions get skipped over. If every attempt at reassurance is rejected, genuine care goes unnoticed."},{"heading":"Advice","body":"The more you can meet in the middle, the more supported and understood you both feel."}],"synastryKb":{"id":"A-jupiter_B-moon_square","kind":"interaspect","plainTranslation":"A''s growth meets B''s feelings. The square puts them in friction.","summaryDeep":"This person cares about how you feel, but they do not always know how to be with your feelings.\n\nWhen you are hurting, they often respond by trying to make the pain feel lighter. Their care comes through reassurance, perspective, and a belief that things can improve. Even when their intentions are good, you may sometimes feel rushed past what you are actually experiencing. What you need in those moments is not a brighter outlook but the feeling that someone truly understands where you are before trying to fix it.\n\nThat can be a lonely feeling. You may know they care about you and still feel like something important got missed. You leave the interaction feeling comforted on the surface, but the deeper part of your experience remains untouched. Their optimism can feel reassuring when you need hope and frustrating when you need understanding.\n\nAt its best, this connection helps you carry your feelings without getting lost in them. They remind you that what hurts right now is not the whole story. When you feel overwhelmed, they bring perspective, helping you step back from the emotion without dismissing it and remember that there is still room for hope.\n\nThe challenge is making room for both truth and comfort. If every difficult feeling gets softened too quickly, important emotions get skipped over. If every attempt at reassurance is rejected, genuine care goes unnoticed.\n\nThe more you can meet in the middle, the more supported and understood you both feel.","tension":"The challenge is making room for both truth and comfort. If every difficult feeling gets softened too quickly, important emotions get skipped over. If every attempt at reassurance is rejected, genuine care goes unnoticed.","advice":"The more you can meet in the middle, the more supported and understood you both feel.","policy":"Governed by synastry-policy. Descriptive, not deterministic; intensity is never treated as obligation, safety concerns override astrology.","note":"Imported from project-authored synastry matrix material. Source file was not copied into the repository.","status":"DRAFT","authoringStatus":"locked","weight":4}}'::jsonb, 'synastry_aspect', 'Seeded from authored synastry KB. summaryShort is preserved as NULL when absent or null.', now()),
  ('A-jupiter_B-moon_trine', 'synastry', 'in_depth', 'LIVE', 'synastry-aspect', null::date, '{"kind":"interaspect","planetA":"jupiter","planetB":"moon","aspect":"trine"}'::jsonb, ARRAY['A-jupiter_B-moon_trine', 'synastry-jupiter-trine-moon', 'relationship-jupiter-trine-moon']::text[], '{"contentType":"synastry-kb-seed","source":"packages/astro-knowledge","sourcePath":"packages/astro-knowledge/data/synastry/aspects/A-jupiter_B-moon_trine.json","collection":"synastry/aspects","kbId":"A-jupiter_B-moon_trine","importedStatus":"DRAFT"}'::jsonb, 'synastry-kb-v1', null, 'Jupiter Trine Moon', null, 'This person has a way of making you feel emotionally supported without drawing attention to it.

Around them, your feelings seem to have somewhere soft to land. Instead of feeling examined or questioned, you often feel received. There is a sense that your inner world makes sense to them, even when you are struggling to make sense of it yourself.

One of the gifts of this connection is the feeling that someone is beside you when life gets heavy. They have a way of helping you remember that a difficult moment is not the whole story, while still respecting the reality of what you are going through. Their support can make it easier to breathe, easier to trust that things will move forward, and easier to feel less alone with whatever you are carrying.

Being cared for this consistently can change something in you. When someone meets your feelings with warmth instead of judgment, you stop bracing for rejection. It becomes easier to trust what you feel, ask for support when you need it, and believe your needs matter.

The challenge is not conflict but complacency. Because the support is so reliable, it can fade into the background. You may forget how much this connection contributes to your well-being, or stop actively nurturing something that feels like it will always be there.

Notice what this person brings into your life. Let yourself receive it fully, and make sure you give it value in return.', '{"sections":[{"heading":"Deep meaning","body":"This person has a way of making you feel emotionally supported without drawing attention to it.\n\nAround them, your feelings seem to have somewhere soft to land. Instead of feeling examined or questioned, you often feel received. There is a sense that your inner world makes sense to them, even when you are struggling to make sense of it yourself.\n\nOne of the gifts of this connection is the feeling that someone is beside you when life gets heavy. They have a way of helping you remember that a difficult moment is not the whole story, while still respecting the reality of what you are going through. Their support can make it easier to breathe, easier to trust that things will move forward, and easier to feel less alone with whatever you are carrying.\n\nBeing cared for this consistently can change something in you. When someone meets your feelings with warmth instead of judgment, you stop bracing for rejection. It becomes easier to trust what you feel, ask for support when you need it, and believe your needs matter.\n\nThe challenge is not conflict but complacency. Because the support is so reliable, it can fade into the background. You may forget how much this connection contributes to your well-being, or stop actively nurturing something that feels like it will always be there.\n\nNotice what this person brings into your life. Let yourself receive it fully, and make sure you give it value in return."},{"heading":"Tension","body":"The challenge is not conflict but complacency. Because the support is so reliable, it can fade into the background. You may forget how much this connection contributes to your well-being, or stop actively nurturing something that feels like it will always be there."},{"heading":"Advice","body":"Notice what this person brings into your life. Let yourself receive it fully, and make sure you give it value in return."}],"synastryKb":{"id":"A-jupiter_B-moon_trine","kind":"interaspect","plainTranslation":"A''s growth meets B''s feelings. The trine lets them flow together easily.","summaryDeep":"This person has a way of making you feel emotionally supported without drawing attention to it.\n\nAround them, your feelings seem to have somewhere soft to land. Instead of feeling examined or questioned, you often feel received. There is a sense that your inner world makes sense to them, even when you are struggling to make sense of it yourself.\n\nOne of the gifts of this connection is the feeling that someone is beside you when life gets heavy. They have a way of helping you remember that a difficult moment is not the whole story, while still respecting the reality of what you are going through. Their support can make it easier to breathe, easier to trust that things will move forward, and easier to feel less alone with whatever you are carrying.\n\nBeing cared for this consistently can change something in you. When someone meets your feelings with warmth instead of judgment, you stop bracing for rejection. It becomes easier to trust what you feel, ask for support when you need it, and believe your needs matter.\n\nThe challenge is not conflict but complacency. Because the support is so reliable, it can fade into the background. You may forget how much this connection contributes to your well-being, or stop actively nurturing something that feels like it will always be there.\n\nNotice what this person brings into your life. Let yourself receive it fully, and make sure you give it value in return.","tension":"The challenge is not conflict but complacency. Because the support is so reliable, it can fade into the background. You may forget how much this connection contributes to your well-being, or stop actively nurturing something that feels like it will always be there.","advice":"Notice what this person brings into your life. Let yourself receive it fully, and make sure you give it value in return.","policy":"Governed by synastry-policy. Descriptive, not deterministic; intensity is never treated as obligation, safety concerns override astrology.","note":"Imported from project-authored synastry matrix material. Source file was not copied into the repository.","status":"DRAFT","authoringStatus":"locked","weight":4}}'::jsonb, 'synastry_aspect', 'Seeded from authored synastry KB. summaryShort is preserved as NULL when absent or null.', now()),
