  ('A-mars_B-venus_conjunction', 'synastry', 'in_depth', 'LIVE', 'synastry-aspect', null::date, '{"kind":"interaspect","planetA":"mars","planetB":"venus","aspect":"conjunction"}'::jsonb, ARRAY['A-mars_B-venus_conjunction', 'synastry-mars-conjunction-venus', 'relationship-mars-conjunction-venus']::text[], '{"contentType":"synastry-kb-seed","source":"packages/astro-knowledge","sourcePath":"packages/astro-knowledge/data/synastry/aspects/A-mars_B-venus_conjunction.json","collection":"synastry/aspects","kbId":"A-mars_B-venus_conjunction","importedStatus":"DRAFT"}'::jsonb, 'synastry-kb-v1', null, 'Mars Conjunction Venus', 'The attraction is immediate. Venus and Mars are in the same place, so there isn''t much distance between liking someone and wanting them. One person''s pull meets the other person''s drive directly, and the chemistry can feel obvious from the start.', 'The attraction is immediate. Venus and Mars are in the same place, so there isn''t much distance between liking someone and wanting them. One person''s pull meets the other person''s drive directly, and the chemistry can feel obvious from the start.

This is the kind of connection where everything feels a little charged, even when the conversation itself is normal. There''s heat, there''s interest, and it can be easy to assume that because the attraction is strong, the relationship must be strong too.

Failure mode: mistaking wanting someone for actually being compatible with them. Things can burn hot and fast, then you realize there may not be much holding it together once the charge settles.

Let the spark introduce you. Then take a minute and see if you actually like each other.', '{"sections":[{"heading":"Deep meaning","body":"The attraction is immediate. Venus and Mars are in the same place, so there isn''t much distance between liking someone and wanting them. One person''s pull meets the other person''s drive directly, and the chemistry can feel obvious from the start.\n\nThis is the kind of connection where everything feels a little charged, even when the conversation itself is normal. There''s heat, there''s interest, and it can be easy to assume that because the attraction is strong, the relationship must be strong too.\n\nFailure mode: mistaking wanting someone for actually being compatible with them. Things can burn hot and fast, then you realize there may not be much holding it together once the charge settles.\n\nLet the spark introduce you. Then take a minute and see if you actually like each other."},{"heading":"Tension","body":"Failure mode: mistaking wanting someone for actually being compatible with them. Things can burn hot and fast, then you realize there may not be much holding it together once the charge settles."},{"heading":"Advice","body":"Let the spark introduce you. Then take a minute and see if you actually like each other."}],"synastryKb":{"id":"A-mars_B-venus_conjunction","kind":"interaspect","plainTranslation":"The Mars person moves toward what the Venus person naturally attracts. Chemistry is immediate, physical, and hard to ignore. The risk is mistaking pursuit for compatibility, so check whether affection, repair, and basic respect exist after the heat settles.","summaryDeep":"The attraction is immediate. Venus and Mars are in the same place, so there isn''t much distance between liking someone and wanting them. One person''s pull meets the other person''s drive directly, and the chemistry can feel obvious from the start.\n\nThis is the kind of connection where everything feels a little charged, even when the conversation itself is normal. There''s heat, there''s interest, and it can be easy to assume that because the attraction is strong, the relationship must be strong too.\n\nFailure mode: mistaking wanting someone for actually being compatible with them. Things can burn hot and fast, then you realize there may not be much holding it together once the charge settles.\n\nLet the spark introduce you. Then take a minute and see if you actually like each other.","tension":"Failure mode: mistaking wanting someone for actually being compatible with them. Things can burn hot and fast, then you realize there may not be much holding it together once the charge settles.","advice":"Let the spark introduce you. Then take a minute and see if you actually like each other.","policy":"Governed by synastry-policy. Descriptive, not deterministic; intensity is never treated as obligation, safety concerns override astrology.","note":"Refined from approved project relationship source material. Source files were not copied into the repository.","status":"DRAFT","authoringStatus":"locked","weight":1}}'::jsonb, 'synastry_aspect', 'Seeded from authored synastry KB. summaryShort is preserved as NULL when absent or null.', now()),
  ('A-mars_B-venus_opposition', 'synastry', 'in_depth', 'LIVE', 'synastry-aspect', null::date, '{"kind":"interaspect","planetA":"mars","planetB":"venus","aspect":"opposition"}'::jsonb, ARRAY['A-mars_B-venus_opposition', 'synastry-mars-opposition-venus', 'relationship-mars-opposition-venus']::text[], '{"contentType":"synastry-kb-seed","source":"packages/astro-knowledge","sourcePath":"packages/astro-knowledge/data/synastry/aspects/A-mars_B-venus_opposition.json","collection":"synastry/aspects","kbId":"A-mars_B-venus_opposition","importedStatus":"DRAFT"}'::jsonb, 'synastry-kb-v1', null, 'Mars Opposition Venus', 'There''s real attraction here, but it may not feel simple. One person might move forward while the other pulls back, and that back-and-forth can become part of the chemistry. The distance creates heat, but it can also make the relationship feel like something always has to be chased.', 'There''s real attraction here, but it may not feel simple. One person might move forward while the other pulls back, and that back-and-forth can become part of the chemistry. The distance creates heat, but it can also make the relationship feel like something always has to be chased.

At its best, this keeps things exciting. At its worst, both people start confusing tension with connection. One person may feel rejected, while the other feels pressured.

Failure mode: only feeling the romance when there is friction, distance, or someone to win over. Once things get simple, the connection may start looking for a new problem.

Say what you want directly. Don''t make the other person figure it out from hints, timing, or attitude.', '{"sections":[{"heading":"Deep meaning","body":"There''s real attraction here, but it may not feel simple. One person might move forward while the other pulls back, and that back-and-forth can become part of the chemistry. The distance creates heat, but it can also make the relationship feel like something always has to be chased.\n\nAt its best, this keeps things exciting. At its worst, both people start confusing tension with connection. One person may feel rejected, while the other feels pressured.\n\nFailure mode: only feeling the romance when there is friction, distance, or someone to win over. Once things get simple, the connection may start looking for a new problem.\n\nSay what you want directly. Don''t make the other person figure it out from hints, timing, or attitude."},{"heading":"Tension","body":"Failure mode: only feeling the romance when there is friction, distance, or someone to win over. Once things get simple, the connection may start looking for a new problem."},{"heading":"Advice","body":"Say what you want directly. Don''t make the other person figure it out from hints, timing, or attitude."}],"synastryKb":{"id":"A-mars_B-venus_opposition","kind":"interaspect","plainTranslation":"The Mars person pushes from desire while the Venus person asks for a different style of affection. The magnetism can feel like chase and retreat. Name the rhythm before it becomes the whole relationship.","summaryDeep":"There''s real attraction here, but it may not feel simple. One person might move forward while the other pulls back, and that back-and-forth can become part of the chemistry. The distance creates heat, but it can also make the relationship feel like something always has to be chased.\n\nAt its best, this keeps things exciting. At its worst, both people start confusing tension with connection. One person may feel rejected, while the other feels pressured.\n\nFailure mode: only feeling the romance when there is friction, distance, or someone to win over. Once things get simple, the connection may start looking for a new problem.\n\nSay what you want directly. Don''t make the other person figure it out from hints, timing, or attitude.","tension":"Failure mode: only feeling the romance when there is friction, distance, or someone to win over. Once things get simple, the connection may start looking for a new problem.","advice":"Say what you want directly. Don''t make the other person figure it out from hints, timing, or attitude.","policy":"Governed by synastry-policy. Descriptive, not deterministic; intensity is never treated as obligation, safety concerns override astrology.","note":"Refined from approved project relationship source material. Source files were not copied into the repository.","status":"DRAFT","authoringStatus":"locked","weight":1}}'::jsonb, 'synastry_aspect', 'Seeded from authored synastry KB. summaryShort is preserved as NULL when absent or null.', now()),
  ('A-mars_B-venus_sextile', 'synastry', 'in_depth', 'LIVE', 'synastry-aspect', null::date, '{"kind":"interaspect","planetA":"mars","planetB":"venus","aspect":"sextile"}'::jsonb, ARRAY['A-mars_B-venus_sextile', 'synastry-mars-sextile-venus', 'relationship-mars-sextile-venus']::text[], '{"contentType":"synastry-kb-seed","source":"packages/astro-knowledge","sourcePath":"packages/astro-knowledge/data/synastry/aspects/A-mars_B-venus_sextile.json","collection":"synastry/aspects","kbId":"A-mars_B-venus_sextile","importedStatus":"DRAFT"}'::jsonb, 'synastry-kb-v1', null, 'Mars Sextile Venus', 'The attraction is there, but it usually needs someone to do something with it. Venus and Mars support each other here, so charm and desire can work well together, but the chemistry may not fully open unless someone makes a move.', 'The attraction is there, but it usually needs someone to do something with it. Venus and Mars support each other here, so charm and desire can work well together, but the chemistry may not fully open unless someone makes a move.

This can start in a subtle way. A little flirting, a little effort, a little willingness to show interest. The more both people participate, the more the attraction has somewhere to go.

