  ('A-mars_B-venus_trine', 'synastry', 'in_depth', 'LIVE', 'synastry-aspect', null::date, '{"kind":"interaspect","planetA":"mars","planetB":"venus","aspect":"trine"}'::jsonb, ARRAY['A-mars_B-venus_trine', 'synastry-mars-trine-venus', 'relationship-mars-trine-venus']::text[], '{"contentType":"synastry-kb-seed","source":"packages/astro-knowledge","sourcePath":"packages/astro-knowledge/data/synastry/aspects/A-mars_B-venus_trine.json","collection":"synastry/aspects","kbId":"A-mars_B-venus_trine","importedStatus":"DRAFT"}'::jsonb, 'synastry-kb-v1', null, 'Mars Trine Venus', 'Desire and attraction move easily here. The chemistry feels natural, warm, and unforced. Nobody has to work too hard to create interest, and there''s often a physical ease between the two people that feels simple in a good way.', 'Desire and attraction move easily here. The chemistry feels natural, warm, and unforced. Nobody has to work too hard to create interest, and there''s often a physical ease between the two people that feels simple in a good way.

This can be a very comfortable kind of attraction. The rhythm makes sense. The timing is easier. There''s less guessing, less proving, and less drama around who wants what.

Failure mode: taking the ease for granted. Because the connection does not demand constant effort, it can quietly stop being fed.

Keep choosing it. Just because something feels natural does not mean it can run forever on its own.', '{"sections":[{"heading":"Deep meaning","body":"Desire and attraction move easily here. The chemistry feels natural, warm, and unforced. Nobody has to work too hard to create interest, and there''s often a physical ease between the two people that feels simple in a good way.\n\nThis can be a very comfortable kind of attraction. The rhythm makes sense. The timing is easier. There''s less guessing, less proving, and less drama around who wants what.\n\nFailure mode: taking the ease for granted. Because the connection does not demand constant effort, it can quietly stop being fed.\n\nKeep choosing it. Just because something feels natural does not mean it can run forever on its own."},{"heading":"Tension","body":"Failure mode: taking the ease for granted. Because the connection does not demand constant effort, it can quietly stop being fed."},{"heading":"Advice","body":"Keep choosing it. Just because something feels natural does not mean it can run forever on its own."}],"synastryKb":{"id":"A-mars_B-venus_trine","kind":"interaspect","plainTranslation":"The Mars person''s desire and the Venus person''s affection usually find each other easily. This is clean attraction with less friction than the harder contacts. Keep putting effort into tenderness, because easy chemistry still needs care to become relationship skill.","summaryDeep":"Desire and attraction move easily here. The chemistry feels natural, warm, and unforced. Nobody has to work too hard to create interest, and there''s often a physical ease between the two people that feels simple in a good way.\n\nThis can be a very comfortable kind of attraction. The rhythm makes sense. The timing is easier. There''s less guessing, less proving, and less drama around who wants what.\n\nFailure mode: taking the ease for granted. Because the connection does not demand constant effort, it can quietly stop being fed.\n\nKeep choosing it. Just because something feels natural does not mean it can run forever on its own.","tension":"Failure mode: taking the ease for granted. Because the connection does not demand constant effort, it can quietly stop being fed.","advice":"Keep choosing it. Just because something feels natural does not mean it can run forever on its own.","policy":"Governed by synastry-policy. Descriptive, not deterministic; intensity is never treated as obligation, safety concerns override astrology.","note":"Refined from approved project relationship source material. Source files were not copied into the repository.","status":"DRAFT","authoringStatus":"locked","weight":1}}'::jsonb, 'synastry_aspect', 'Seeded from authored synastry KB. summaryShort is preserved as NULL when absent or null.', now()),
  ('A-mercury_B-jupiter_conjunction', 'synastry', 'in_depth', 'LIVE', 'synastry-aspect', null::date, '{"kind":"interaspect","planetA":"mercury","planetB":"jupiter","aspect":"conjunction"}'::jsonb, ARRAY['A-mercury_B-jupiter_conjunction', 'synastry-mercury-conjunction-jupiter', 'relationship-mercury-conjunction-jupiter']::text[], '{"contentType":"synastry-kb-seed","source":"packages/astro-knowledge","sourcePath":"packages/astro-knowledge/data/synastry/aspects/A-mercury_B-jupiter_conjunction.json","collection":"synastry/aspects","kbId":"A-mercury_B-jupiter_conjunction","importedStatus":"DRAFT"}'::jsonb, 'synastry-kb-v1', null, 'Mercury Conjunction Jupiter', null, 'This is the person who reminds you not to think so small. You bring them an idea, a question, a possibility, and somehow it comes back larger. They see opportunities where you see loose ends. They spot potential before there is proof. Their perspective can help you zoom out from the immediate problem and reconnect with the bigger vision of what you are trying to create.

They have a way of helping you see beyond the limits you place on yourself. Through conversation, they broaden your perspective, encourage you to think bigger, and remind you of possibilities you may have overlooked. Around them, your ideas often feel more viable, and your confidence in pursuing them tends to grow.

There is something deeply affirming about being seen this way. Their faith in your potential can help you access more of it. They remind you that your ideas deserve room to develop, that curiosity is worth following, and that ambition is not something you need to apologize for.

The challenge is that inspiration can start to masquerade as progress. A conversation can feel so productive, so exciting, so full of possibility that neither of you notices nothing has actually moved forward yet. The vision expands, but the next step remains undefined.

Take the encouragement. Take the perspective. Then bring it down to earth.', '{"sections":[{"heading":"Deep meaning","body":"This is the person who reminds you not to think so small. You bring them an idea, a question, a possibility, and somehow it comes back larger. They see opportunities where you see loose ends. They spot potential before there is proof. Their perspective can help you zoom out from the immediate problem and reconnect with the bigger vision of what you are trying to create.\n\nThey have a way of helping you see beyond the limits you place on yourself. Through conversation, they broaden your perspective, encourage you to think bigger, and remind you of possibilities you may have overlooked. Around them, your ideas often feel more viable, and your confidence in pursuing them tends to grow.\n\nThere is something deeply affirming about being seen this way. Their faith in your potential can help you access more of it. They remind you that your ideas deserve room to develop, that curiosity is worth following, and that ambition is not something you need to apologize for.\n\nThe challenge is that inspiration can start to masquerade as progress. A conversation can feel so productive, so exciting, so full of possibility that neither of you notices nothing has actually moved forward yet. The vision expands, but the next step remains undefined.\n\nTake the encouragement. Take the perspective. Then bring it down to earth."},{"heading":"Tension","body":"The challenge is that inspiration can start to masquerade as progress. A conversation can feel so productive, so exciting, so full of possibility that neither of you notices nothing has actually moved forward yet. The vision expands, but the next step remains undefined."},{"heading":"Advice","body":"Take the encouragement. Take the perspective. Then bring it down to earth."}],"synastryKb":{"id":"A-mercury_B-jupiter_conjunction","kind":"interaspect","plainTranslation":"A''s mind meets B''s growth. The conjunction fuses them - intense and inseparable.","summaryDeep":"This is the person who reminds you not to think so small. You bring them an idea, a question, a possibility, and somehow it comes back larger. They see opportunities where you see loose ends. They spot potential before there is proof. Their perspective can help you zoom out from the immediate problem and reconnect with the bigger vision of what you are trying to create.\n\nThey have a way of helping you see beyond the limits you place on yourself. Through conversation, they broaden your perspective, encourage you to think bigger, and remind you of possibilities you may have overlooked. Around them, your ideas often feel more viable, and your confidence in pursuing them tends to grow.\n\nThere is something deeply affirming about being seen this way. Their faith in your potential can help you access more of it. They remind you that your ideas deserve room to develop, that curiosity is worth following, and that ambition is not something you need to apologize for.\n\nThe challenge is that inspiration can start to masquerade as progress. A conversation can feel so productive, so exciting, so full of possibility that neither of you notices nothing has actually moved forward yet. The vision expands, but the next step remains undefined.\n\nTake the encouragement. Take the perspective. Then bring it down to earth.","tension":"The challenge is that inspiration can start to masquerade as progress. A conversation can feel so productive, so exciting, so full of possibility that neither of you notices nothing has actually moved forward yet. The vision expands, but the next step remains undefined.","advice":"Take the encouragement. Take the perspective. Then bring it down to earth.","policy":"Governed by synastry-policy. Descriptive, not deterministic; intensity is never treated as obligation, safety concerns override astrology.","note":"Imported from project-authored synastry matrix material. Source file was not copied into the repository.","status":"DRAFT","authoringStatus":"locked","weight":4}}'::jsonb, 'synastry_aspect', 'Seeded from authored synastry KB. summaryShort is preserved as NULL when absent or null.', now()),
  ('A-mercury_B-jupiter_opposition', 'synastry', 'in_depth', 'LIVE', 'synastry-aspect', null::date, '{"kind":"interaspect","planetA":"mercury","planetB":"jupiter","aspect":"opposition"}'::jsonb, ARRAY['A-mercury_B-jupiter_opposition', 'synastry-mercury-opposition-jupiter', 'relationship-mercury-opposition-jupiter']::text[], '{"contentType":"synastry-kb-seed","source":"packages/astro-knowledge","sourcePath":"packages/astro-knowledge/data/synastry/aspects/A-mercury_B-jupiter_opposition.json","collection":"synastry/aspects","kbId":"A-mercury_B-jupiter_opposition","importedStatus":"DRAFT"}'::jsonb, 'synastry-kb-v1', null, 'Mercury Opposition Jupiter', null, 'This person often challenges the scale of your thinking.

You may approach a situation by looking at what is practical, immediate, or supported by the facts in front of you, while they are more interested in where things could lead or what larger meaning might be unfolding. Conversations between you can stretch your perspective, even when you do not agree. Sometimes their outlook feels inspiring and helps you see beyond your usual assumptions. Other times, it can seem like they are overlooking important details in favor of a bigger vision.

This connection works best when you combine those different strengths. They broaden the conversation and help you consider possibilities you might not have explored, while you bring focus and help identify what is actually workable. Together, you can balance vision with practicality.

When the tension rises, both of you can become attached to your own version of the truth. They may experience you as limiting or overly cautious. You may experience them as disconnected from what is actually possible. The gift of this aspect is perspective, but under stress, perspective can harden into certainty, and certainty leaves little room to learn from one another.

The invitation here is to stop treating the difference as a problem to solve. Their perspective can open doors you would never have considered, while your judgment keeps those possibilities connected to reality. Neither view is enough on its own. The real strength of this connection comes when vision and discernment work together, turning possibility into a roadmap you can actually follow.', '{"sections":[{"heading":"Deep meaning","body":"This person often challenges the scale of your thinking.\n\nYou may approach a situation by looking at what is practical, immediate, or supported by the facts in front of you, while they are more interested in where things could lead or what larger meaning might be unfolding. Conversations between you can stretch your perspective, even when you do not agree. Sometimes their outlook feels inspiring and helps you see beyond your usual assumptions. Other times, it can seem like they are overlooking important details in favor of a bigger vision.\n\nThis connection works best when you combine those different strengths. They broaden the conversation and help you consider possibilities you might not have explored, while you bring focus and help identify what is actually workable. Together, you can balance vision with practicality.\n\nWhen the tension rises, both of you can become attached to your own version of the truth. They may experience you as limiting or overly cautious. You may experience them as disconnected from what is actually possible. The gift of this aspect is perspective, but under stress, perspective can harden into certainty, and certainty leaves little room to learn from one another.\n\nThe invitation here is to stop treating the difference as a problem to solve. Their perspective can open doors you would never have considered, while your judgment keeps those possibilities connected to reality. Neither view is enough on its own. The real strength of this connection comes when vision and discernment work together, turning possibility into a roadmap you can actually follow."},{"heading":"Tension","body":"When the tension rises, both of you can become attached to your own version of the truth. They may experience you as limiting or overly cautious. You may experience them as disconnected from what is actually possible. The gift of this aspect is perspective, but under stress, perspective can harden into certainty, and certainty leaves little room to learn from one another."},{"heading":"Advice","body":"The invitation here is to stop treating the difference as a problem to solve. Their perspective can open doors you would never have considered, while your judgment keeps those possibilities connected to reality. Neither view is enough on its own. The real strength of this connection comes when vision and discernment work together, turning possibility into a roadmap you can actually follow."}],"synastryKb":{"id":"A-mercury_B-jupiter_opposition","kind":"interaspect","plainTranslation":"A''s mind meets B''s growth. The opposition pulls them into push-and-pull.","summaryDeep":"This person often challenges the scale of your thinking.\n\nYou may approach a situation by looking at what is practical, immediate, or supported by the facts in front of you, while they are more interested in where things could lead or what larger meaning might be unfolding. Conversations between you can stretch your perspective, even when you do not agree. Sometimes their outlook feels inspiring and helps you see beyond your usual assumptions. Other times, it can seem like they are overlooking important details in favor of a bigger vision.\n\nThis connection works best when you combine those different strengths. They broaden the conversation and help you consider possibilities you might not have explored, while you bring focus and help identify what is actually workable. Together, you can balance vision with practicality.\n\nWhen the tension rises, both of you can become attached to your own version of the truth. Th