  ('A-mercury_B-saturn_square', 'synastry', 'in_depth', 'LIVE', 'synastry-aspect', null::date, '{"kind":"interaspect","planetA":"mercury","planetB":"saturn","aspect":"square"}'::jsonb, ARRAY['A-mercury_B-saturn_square', 'synastry-mercury-square-saturn', 'relationship-mercury-square-saturn']::text[], '{"contentType":"synastry-kb-seed","source":"packages/astro-knowledge","sourcePath":"packages/astro-knowledge/data/synastry/aspects/A-mercury_B-saturn_square.json","collection":"synastry/aspects","kbId":"A-mercury_B-saturn_square","importedStatus":"REVIEWED"}'::jsonb, 'synastry-kb-v1', null, 'Mercury Square Saturn', null, 'Communication grinds against authority. The Mercury person feels criticized, doubted, or shut down; the Saturn person finds the other''s thinking loose or unserious. Conversations go heavy or cold. Failure mode: the Saturn person belittling the Mercury person''s mind. Workable if Saturn offers structure without judgment and Mercury hears rigor, not rejection.', '{"sections":[{"heading":"Translation","body":"Communication grinds against authority. The Mercury person feels criticized, doubted, or shut down; the Saturn person finds the other''s thinking loose or unserious. Conversations go heavy or cold. Failure mode: the Saturn person belittling the Mercury person''s mind. Workable if Saturn offers structure without judgment and Mercury hears rigor, not rejection."}],"synastryKb":{"id":"A-mercury_B-saturn_square","kind":"interaspect","plainTranslation":"Communication grinds against authority. The Mercury person feels criticized, doubted, or shut down; the Saturn person finds the other''s thinking loose or unserious. Conversations go heavy or cold. Failure mode: the Saturn person belittling the Mercury person''s mind. Workable if Saturn offers structure without judgment and Mercury hears rigor, not rejection.","summaryDeep":null,"tension":null,"advice":null,"policy":"Governed by synastry-policy. Descriptive, not deterministic; intensity is never treated a