  ('A-mercury_B-uranus_trine', 'synastry', 'in_depth', 'LIVE', 'synastry-aspect', null::date, '{"kind":"interaspect","planetA":"mercury","planetB":"uranus","aspect":"trine"}'::jsonb, ARRAY['A-mercury_B-uranus_trine', 'synastry-mercury-trine-uranus', 'relationship-mercury-trine-uranus']::text[], '{"contentType":"synastry-kb-seed","source":"packages/astro-knowledge","sourcePath":"packages/astro-knowledge/data/synastry/aspects/A-mercury_B-uranus_trine.json","collection":"synastry/aspects","kbId":"A-mercury_B-uranus_trine","importedStatus":"DRAFT"}'::jsonb, 'synastry-kb-v1', null, 'Mercury Trine Uranus', null, 'A''s mind meets B''s need for freedom. The trine lets them flow together easily.', '{"sections":[{"heading":"Translation","body":"A''s mind meets B''s need for freedom. The trine lets them flow together easily."}],"synastryKb":{"id":"A-mercury_B-uranus_trine","kind":"interaspect","plainTranslation":"A''s mind meets B''s need for freedom. The trine lets them flow together easily.","summaryDeep":null,"tension":null,"advice":null,"policy":"Governed by synastry-policy. Descriptive, not deterministic; intensity is never treated as obligation, safety concerns override astrology.","note":"Imported from project-authored synastry matrix material. Source file was not copied into the repository.","status":"DRAFT","authoringStatus":null,"weight":null}}'::jsonb, 'synastry_aspect', 'Seeded from authored synastry KB. summaryShort is preserved as NULL when absent or null.', now()),
  ('A-mercury_B-venus_conjunction', 'synastry', 'in_depth', 'LIVE', 'synastry-aspect', null::date, '{"kind":"interaspect","planetA":"mercury","planetB":"venus","aspect":"conjunction"}'::jsonb, ARRAY['A-mercury_B-venus_conjunction', 'synastry-mercury-conjunction-venus', 'relationship-mercury-conjunction-venus']::text[], '{"contentType":"synastry-kb-seed","source":"packages/astro-knowledge","sourcePath":"packages/astro-knowledge/data/synastry/aspects/A-mercury_B-venus_conjunction.json","collection":"synastry/aspects","kbId":"A-mercury_B-venus_conjunction","importedStatus":"DRAFT"}'::jsonb, 'synastry-kb-v1', null, 'Mercury Conjunction Venus', null, 'This connection often feels good from the start. There may be something about the way this person speaks that puts you at ease. Their words can make you feel seen, appreciated, and understood. After spending time with them, you may walk away feeling a little lighter, a little more confident, or simply more like yourself.

When this aspect flows well, conversation becomes a source of connection. You encourage each other naturally. You may spend hours sharing ideas, talking about your hopes, or reflecting on life together. There is often a feeling that this person understands where you''re coming from, and that feeling can be deeply attractive.

You may also find that your values align in meaningful ways. What matters to you matters to them.

The downside is that comfort can become a habit. When things are easy between you, it''s tempting to stick to what feels good and avoid the conversations that are messier, riskier, or harder to navigate.

One of the gifts of this connection is that you naturally help each other feel seen and valued. That creates a strong foundation. The opportunity is to build on it.', '{"sections":[{"heading":"Deep meaning","body":"This connection often feels good from the start. There may be something about the way this person speaks that puts you at ease. Their words can make you feel seen, appreciated, and understood. After spending time with them, you may walk away feeling a little lighter, a little more confident, or simply more like yourself.\n\nWhen this aspect flows well, conversation becomes a source of connection. You encourage each other naturally. You may spend hours sharing ideas, talking about your hopes, or reflecting on life together. There is often a feeling that this person understands where you''re coming from, and that feeling can be deeply attractive.\n\nYou may also find that your values align in meaningful ways. What matters to you matters to them.\n\nThe downside is that comfort can become a habit. When things are easy between you, it''s tempting to stick to what feels good and avoid the conversations that are messier, riskier, or harder to navigate.\n\nOne of the gifts of this connection is that you naturally help each other feel seen and valued. That creates a strong foundation. The opportunity is to build on it."},{"heading":"Tension","body":"The downside is that comfort can become a habit. When things are easy between you, it''s tempting to stick to what feels good and avoid the conversations that are messier, riskier, or harder to navigate."},{"heading":"Advice","body":"One of the gifts of this connection is that you naturally help each other feel seen and valued. That creates a strong foundation. The opportunity is to build on it."}],"synastryKb":{"id":"A-mercury_B-venus_conjunction","kind":"interaspect","plainTranslation":"A''s mind meets B''s love and values. The conjunction fuses them - intense and inseparable.","summaryDeep":"This connection often feels good from the start. There may be something about the way this person speaks that puts you at ease. Their words can make you feel seen, appreciated, and understood. After spending time with them, you may walk away feeling a little lighter, a little more confident, or simply more like yourself.\n\nWhen this aspect flows well, conversation becomes a source of connection. You encourage each other naturally. You may spend hours sharing ideas, talking about your hopes, or reflecting on life together. There is often a feeling that this person understands where you''re coming from, and that feeling can be deeply attractive.\n\nYou may also find that your values align in meaningful ways. What matters to you matters to them.\n\nThe downside is that comfort can become a habit. When things are easy between you, it''s tempting to stick to what feels good and avoid the conversations that are messier, riskier, or harder to navigate.\n\nOne of the gifts of this connection is that you naturally help each other feel seen and valued. That creates a strong foundation. The opportunity is to build on it.","tension":"The downside is that comfort can become a habit. When things are easy between you, it''s tempting to stick to what feels good and avoid the conversations that are messier, riskier, or harder to navigate.","advice":"One of the gifts of this connection is that you naturally help each other feel seen and valued. That creates a strong foundation. The opportunity is to build on it.","policy":"Governed by synastry-policy. Descriptive, not deterministic; intensity is never treated as obligation, safety concerns override astrology.","note":"Imported from project-authored synastry matrix material. Source file was not copied into the repository.","status":"DRAFT","authoringStatus":"locked","weight":3}}'::jsonb, 'synastry_aspect', 'Seeded from authored synastry KB. summaryShort is preserved as NULL when absent or null.', now()),
  ('A-mercury_B-venus_opposition', 'synastry', 'in_depth', 'LIVE', 'synastry-aspect', null::date, '{"kind":"interaspect","planetA":"mercury","planetB":"venus","aspect":"opposition"}'::jsonb, ARRAY['A-mercury_B-venus_opposition', 'synastry-mercury-opposition-venus', 'relationship-mercury-opposition-venus']::text[], '{"contentType":"synastry-kb-seed","source":"packages/astro-knowledge","sourcePath":"packages/astro-knowledge/data/synastry/aspects/A-mercury_B-venus_opposition.json","collection":"synastry/aspects","kbId":"A-mercury_B-venus_opposition","importedStatus":"DRAFT"}'::jsonb, 'synastry-kb-v1', null, 'Mercury Opposition Venus', null, 'This connection asks you to stretch beyond your usual understanding of affection.

This person may communicate care in ways that feel unfamiliar to you. The way they flirt, compliment, joke, or express appreciation may not be what you instinctively recognize as warmth. Still, there may be something magnetic about the contrast. Their way of expressing affection can challenge your assumptions and open you to forms of care you might not have noticed before.

Oppositions often bring us face-to-face with another perspective. In this case, the contrast can be compelling. This person may express warmth, affection, or appreciation in ways that feel unfamiliar to you. Their approach can stretch your understanding of connection, showing you that care does not always arrive in the form you expect. Over time, you may discover new ways of giving and receiving affection through the differences between you.

The challenge is that affection does not always arrive in a recognizable form. One person may think they are showing care, while the other does not feel cared for at all. What one person sees as thoughtful may feel distant to the other. What feels sincere may feel awkward. What seems obvious may not register at all.

Both people can end up feeling unseen. Each may be trying to connect in a genuine way, but what they offer is not what the other person needs. Even when there is care between you, it can be difficult to feel fully reached or understood.

The more clearly you learn how each of you gives and receives affection, the easier it becomes to recognize the care that is already there.', '{"sections":[{"heading":"Deep meaning","body":"This connection asks you to stretch beyond your usual understanding of affection.\n\nThis person may communicate care in ways that feel unfamiliar to you. The way they flirt, compliment, joke, or express appreciation may not be what you instinctively recognize as warmth. Still, there may be something magnetic about the contrast. Their way of expressing affection can challenge your assumptions and open you to forms of care you might not have noticed before.\n\nOppositions often bring us face-to-face with another perspective. In this case, the contrast can be compelling. This person may express warmth, affection, or appreciation in ways that feel unfamiliar to you. Their approach can stretch your understanding of connection, showing you that care does not always arrive in the form you expect. Over time, you may discover new ways of giving and receiving affection through the differences between you.\n\nThe challenge is that affection does not always arrive in a recognizable form. One person may think they are showing care, while the other does not feel cared for at all. What one person sees as thoughtful may feel distant to the other. What feels sincere may feel awkward. What seems obvious may not register at all.\n\nBoth people can end up feeling unseen. Each may be trying to connect in a genuine way, but what they offer is not what the other person needs. Even when there is care between you, it can be difficult to feel fully reached or understood.\n\nThe more clearly you learn how each of you gives and receives affection, the easier it becomes to recognize the care that is already there."},{"heading":"Tension","body":"The challenge is that affection does not always arrive in a recognizable form. One person may think they are showing care, while the other does not feel cared for at