  ('A-moon_B-saturn_conjunction', 'synastry', 'in_depth', 'LIVE', 'synastry-aspect', null::date, '{"kind":"interaspect","planetA":"moon","planetB":"saturn","aspect":"conjunction"}'::jsonb, ARRAY['A-moon_B-saturn_conjunction', 'synastry-moon-conjunction-saturn', 'relationship-moon-conjunction-saturn']::text[], '{"contentType":"synastry-kb-seed","source":"packages/astro-knowledge","sourcePath":"packages/astro-knowledge/data/synastry/aspects/A-moon_B-saturn_conjunction.json","collection":"synastry/aspects","kbId":"A-moon_B-saturn_conjunction","importedStatus":"REVIEWED"}'::jsonb, 'synastry-kb-v1', null, 'Moon Conjunction Saturn', null, 'Deep loyalty fused with real weight. The Saturn person grounds and steadies the Moon person; the Moon person can feel held at arm''s length, judged, or quietly unmet. One of the strongest stay-together contacts, and one that can calcify into duty without warmth. Failure mode: the structure outlasts the affection and committed becomes cold. Say the warmth out loud and often; if it''s obligation with no tenderness left, name that instead of calling it depth.', '{"sections":[{"heading":"Translation","body":"Deep loyalty fused with real weight. The Saturn person grounds and steadies the Moon person; the Moon person can feel held at arm''s length, judged, or quietly unmet. One of the strongest stay-together contacts, and one that can calcify into duty without warmth. Failure mode: the structure outlasts the affection and committed becomes cold. Say the warmth out loud and often; if it''s obligation with no tenderness left, name that instead of calling it depth."}],"synastryKb":{"id":"A-moon_B-saturn_conjunction","kind":"interaspect","plainTranslation":"Deep loyalty fused with real weight. The Saturn person grounds and steadies the Moon person; the Moon person can feel held at arm''s length, judged, or quietly unmet. One of the strongest stay-together contacts, and one that can calcify into duty without warmth. Failure mode: the structure outlasts the affection and committed becomes cold. Say the warmth out loud and often; if it''s obligation with no tenderness left, name that instead of calling it depth.","summaryDeep":null,"tension":null,"advice":null,"policy":"Governed by synastry-policy. Descriptive, not deterministic; intensity is never treated as obligation, safety concerns override astrology.","note":"Imported from approved project marquee synastry aspect material. Source file was not copied into the repository.","status":"REVIEWED","authoringStatus":null,"weight":null}}'::jsonb, 'synastry_aspect', 'Seeded from authored synastry KB. summaryShort is preserved as NULL when absent or null.', now()),
  ('A-moon_B-saturn_opposition', 'synastry', 'in_depth', 'LIVE', 'synastry-aspect', null::date, '{"kind":"interaspect","planetA":"moon","planetB":"saturn","aspect":"opposition"}'::jsonb, ARRAY['A-moon_B-saturn_opposition', 'synastry-moon-opposition-saturn', 'relationship-moon-opposition-saturn']::text[], '{"contentType":"synastry-kb-seed","source":"packages/astro-knowledge","sourcePath":"packages/astro-knowledge/data/synastry/aspects/A-moon_B-saturn_opposition.json","collection":"synastry/aspects","kbId":"A-moon_B-saturn_opposition","importedStatus":"REVIEWED"}'::jsonb, 'synastry-kb-v1', null, 'Moon Opposition Saturn', null, 'Need versus distance, across the table. One wants more closeness; the other guards the gate, often from fear rather than malice. Failure mode: a pursue-withdraw loop where both feel wronged. Set terms you both say out loud, and don''t mistake someone''s walls for emotional depth.', '{"sections":[{"heading":"Translation","body":"Need versus distance, across the table. One wants more closeness; the other guards the gate, often from fear rather than malice. Failure mode: a pursue-withdraw loop where both feel wronged. Set terms you both say out loud, and don''t mistake someone''s walls for emotional depth."}],"synastryKb":{"id":"A-moon_B-saturn_opposition","kind":"interaspect","plainTranslation":"Need versus distance, across the table. One wants more closeness; the other guards the gate, often from fear rather than malice. Failure mode: a pursue-withdraw loop where both feel wronged. Set terms you both say out loud, and don''t mistake someone''s walls for emotional depth.","summaryDeep":null,"tension":null,"advice":null,"policy":"Governed by synastry-policy. Descriptive, not deterministic; intensity is never treated as obligation, safety concerns override astrology.","note":"Imported from approved project marquee synastry aspect material. Source file was not copied into the repository.","status":"REVIEWED","authoringStatus":null,"weight":null}}'::