  ('A-moon_B-saturn_sextile', 'synastry', 'in_depth', 'LIVE', 'synastry-aspect', null::date, '{"kind":"interaspect","planetA":"moon","planetB":"saturn","aspect":"sextile"}'::jsonb, ARRAY['A-moon_B-saturn_sextile', 'synastry-moon-sextile-saturn', 'relationship-moon-sextile-saturn']::text[], '{"contentType":"synastry-kb-seed","source":"packages/astro-knowledge","sourcePath":"packages/astro-knowledge/data/synastry/aspects/A-moon_B-saturn_sextile.json","collection":"synastry/aspects","kbId":"A-moon_B-saturn_sextile","importedStatus":"REVIEWED"}'::jsonb, 'synastry-kb-v1', null, 'Moon Sextile Saturn', null, 'A supportive blend of feeling and stability. The Saturn person offers reliability; the Moon person softens the Saturn person''s edges, and it''s there without strain. Failure mode: under-using it - the steadiness exists but you don''t lean on it. Build the routines and commitments that make the emotional safety concrete.', '{"sections":[{"heading":"Translation","body":"A supportive blend of feeling and stability. The Saturn person offers reliability; the Moon person softens the Saturn person''s edges, and it''s there without strain. Failure mode: under-using it - the steadiness exists but you don''t lean on it. Build the routines and commitments that make the emotional safety concrete."}],"synastryKb":{"id":"A-moon_B-saturn_sextile","kind":"interaspect","plainTranslation":"A supportive blend of feeling and stability. The Saturn person offers reliability; the Moon person softens the Saturn person''s edges, and it''s there without strain. Failure mode: under-using it - the steadiness exists but you don''t lean on it. Build the routines and commitments that make the emotional safety concrete.","summaryDeep":null,"tension":null,"advice":null,"policy":"Governed by synastry-policy. Descriptive, not deterministic; intensity is never treated as obligation, safety concerns override astrology.","note":"Imported from approved project marquee synastry aspect material. Source file was not copied into the repository.","status":"REVIEWED","authoringStatus":null,"weight":null}}'::jsonb, 'synastry_aspect', 'Seeded from authored synastry KB. summaryShort is preserved as NULL when absent or null.', now()),
  ('A-moon_B-saturn_square', 'synastry', 'in_depth', 'LIVE', 'synastry-aspect', null::date, '{"kind":"interaspect","planetA":"moon","planetB":"saturn","aspect":"square"}'::jsonb, ARRAY['A-moon_B-saturn_square', 'synastry-moon-square-saturn', 'relationship-moon-square-saturn']::text[], '{"contentType":"synastry-kb-seed","source":"packages/astro-knowledge","sourcePath":"packages/astro-knowledge/data/synastry/aspects/A-moon_B-saturn_square.json","collection":"synastry/aspects","kbId":"A-moon_B-saturn_square","importedStatus":"REVIEWED"}'::jsonb, 'synastry-kb-v1', null, 'Moon Square Saturn', 'This aspect can make emotional needs feel heavy. The Moon person may want warmth or reassurance, while the Saturn person may respond with caution, distance, duty, or restraint.', 'The Moon needs care. Saturn needs control, time, structure, and proof. When these two square each other, emotional expression can feel complicated. The Moon person may feel like their needs are too much. The Saturn person may feel responsible for emotions they do not know how to meet.

The Saturn person may not be cold on purpose. They may be afraid of doing the wrong thing, afraid of being needed, afraid of failing, or simply used to handling feelings through silence and discipline. But to the Moon person, this can feel like rejection.

This aspect can create loyalty, especially over time. Saturn may stay. Saturn may show up in practical ways. Saturn may protect the Moon person through consistency, effort, and responsibility. But the relationship cannot live on duty alone. The Moon still needs warmth, responsiveness, and emotional presence.

When this works, both people mature. The Moon learns not to collapse into need. Saturn learns not to punish vulnerability. When it does not, one person becomes hungry for care while the other becomes the gatekeeper of warmth.

It may show up as one person feeling emotionally shut out, practical support replacing affection, fear of being too needy, delayed vulnerability, or loyalty that grows slowly.

Emotional needs can feel judged, delayed, minimized, or burdensome.

Do not make someone earn basic care. Do not demand emotional availability from someone who has not learned how to offer it. Name what support looks like in practical terms.', '{"sections":[{"heading":"Deep meaning","body":"The Moon needs care. Saturn needs control, time, structure, and proof. When these two square each other, emotional expression can feel complicated. The Moon person may feel like their needs are too much. The Saturn person may feel responsible for emotions they do not know how to meet.\n\nThe Saturn person may not be cold on purpose. They may be afraid of doing the wrong thing, afraid of being needed, afraid of failing, or simply used to handling feelings through silence and discipline. But to the Moon person, this can feel like rejection.\n\nThis aspect can create loyalty, especially over time. Saturn may stay. Saturn may show up in practical ways. Saturn may protect the Moon person through consistency, effort, and responsibility. But the relationship cannot live on duty alone. The Moon still needs warmth, responsiveness, and emotional presence.\n\nWhen this works, both people mature. The Moon learns not to collapse into need. Saturn learns not to punish vulnerability. When it does not, one person becomes hungry for care while the other becomes the gatekeeper of warmth.\n\nIt may show up as one person feeling emotionally shut out, practical support replacing affection, fear of being too needy, delayed vulnerability, or loyalty that grows slowly."},{"heading":"Tension","body":"Emotional needs can feel judged, delayed, minimized, or burdensome."},{"heading":"Advice","body":"Do not make someone earn basic care. Do not demand emotional availability from someone who has not learned how to offer it. Name what support looks like in practical terms."}],"synastryKb":{"id":"A-moon_B-saturn_square","kind":"interaspect","plainTranslation":"This aspect can make emotional needs feel heavy. The Moon person may want warmth or reassurance, while the Saturn person may respond with caution, distance, duty, or restraint.","summaryDeep":"The Moon needs care. Saturn needs control, time, structure, and proof. When these two square each other, emotional expression can feel complicated. The Moon person may feel like their needs are too much. The Saturn person may feel responsible for emotions they do not know how to meet.\n\nThe Saturn person may not be cold on purpose. They may be afraid of doing the wrong thing, afraid of being needed, afraid of failing, or simply used to handling feelings through silence and discipline. But to the Moon person, this can feel like rejection.\n\nThis aspect can create loyalty, especially over time. Saturn may stay. Saturn may show up in practical ways. Saturn may protect the Moon person through consistency, effort, and responsibility. But the relationship cannot live on duty alone. The Moon still needs warmth, responsiveness, and emotional presence.\n\nWhen this works, both people mature. The Moon learns not to collapse into need. Saturn learns not to punish vulnerability. When it does not, one person becomes hungry for care while the other becomes the gatekeeper of warmth.\n\nIt may show up as one person feeling emotionally shut out, practical support replacing affection, fear of being too needy, delayed vulnerability, or loyalty that grows slowly.","tension":"Emotional needs can feel judged, delayed, minimized, or burdensome.","advice":"Do not make someone earn basic care. Do not demand emotional availability from someone who has not learned how to offer it. Name what support looks like in practical terms.","policy":"Governed by synastry-policy. Descriptive, not deterministic; intensity is never treated as obligation, safety concerns override astrology.","note":"Gold standard Batch 2. Gift: devotion, steadiness, emotional maturity, and care that proves itself over time. Shadow: withholding, guilt, emotional loneliness, fear of need, or staying because the bond feels like a responsibility.","status":"REVIEWED","authoringStatus":"locked","weight":5}}'::jsonb, 'synastry_aspect', 'Seeded from authored synastry KB. summaryShort is preserved as NULL when absent or null.', now()),
  ('A-moon_B-saturn_trine', 'synastry', 'in_depth', 'LIVE', 'synastry-aspect', null::date, '{"kind":"interaspect","planetA":"moon","planetB":"saturn","aspect":"trine"}'::jsonb, ARRAY['A-moon_B-saturn_trine', 'synastry-moon-trine-saturn', 'relationship-moon-trine-saturn']::text[], '{"contentType":"synastry-kb-seed","source":"packages/astro-knowledge","sourcePath":"packages/astro-knowledge/data/synastry/aspects/A-moon_B-saturn_trine.json","collection":"synastry/aspects","kbId":"A-moon_B-saturn_trine","importedStatus":"REVIEWED"}'::jsonb, 'synastry-kb-v1', null, 'Moon Trine Saturn', null, 'Emotional security that comes easily. Quiet commitment, dependable warmth, the sense of being safely held. Failure mode: steady drifts toward flat if no one adds heat. Use the stability to commit to something lasting, and keep warmth deliberate so it doesn''t go quiet.', '{"sections":[{"heading":"Translation","body":"Emotional security that comes easily. Quiet commitment, dependable warmth, the sense of being safely held. Failure mode: steady drifts toward flat if no one adds heat. Use the stability to commit to something lasting, and keep warmth deliberate so it doesn''t go quiet."}],"synastryKb":{"id":"A-moon_B-saturn_trine","kind":"interaspect","plainTranslation":"Emotional security that comes easily. Quiet commitment, dependable warmth, the sense of being safely held. Failure mode: steady drifts toward flat if no one adds heat. Use the stability to commit to something lasting, and keep warmth deliberate so it doesn''t go quiet.","summaryDeep":null,"tension":null,"advice":null,"policy":"Governed by synastry-policy. Descriptive, not deterministic; intensity is never treated as obligation, safety concerns override astrology.","note":"Imported from approved project marquee synastry aspect material. Source file was not copied into the repository.","status":"REVIEWED","authoringStatus":null,"weight":null}}'::jsonb, 'synastry_aspect', 'Seeded from authored synastry KB. summaryShort is preserved as NULL when absent or null.', now()),
  ('A-moon_B-sun_conjunction', 'synastry', 'in_depth', 'LIVE', 'synastry-aspect', null::date, '{"kind":"interaspect","planetA":"moon","planetB":"sun","aspect":"conjunction"}'::jsonb, ARRAY['A-moon_B-sun_conjunction', 'synastry-moon-conjunction-sun', 'relationship-moon-conjunction-sun']::text[], '{"contentType":"synastry-kb-seed","source":"packages/astro-knowledge","sourcePath":"packages/astro-knowledge/data/synastry/aspects/A-moon_B-sun_conjunction.json","collection":"synastry/aspects","kbId":"A-moon_B-sun_conjunction","importedStatus":"DRAFT"}'::jsonb, 'synastry-kb-v1', null, 'Moon Conjunction Sun', 'This can feel familiar right away. One person''s personality fits easily with the other person''s emotional needs, so being around each other may feel natural without either of you doing much.', 'This can feel familiar right away. One person''s personality fits easily with the other person''s emotional needs, so being around each other may feel natural without either of you doing much.

There''s a real comfort here. One person may feel seen, and the other may feel needed in a way that actually feels good. It''s not always dramatic or flashy. It''s more like, "Oh, I can relax around you."

The problem is that comfort can turn into dependence. One person may start expecting the other to always be their soft place to land, and the relationship can get a little too comfortable without anyone noticing.

Enjoy the closeness, but don''t disappear into it. This works best when both people still have their own life.', '{"sections":[{"heading":"Deep meaning","body":"This can feel familiar right away. One person''s personality fits easily with the other person''s emotional needs, so being around each other may feel natural without either of you doing much.\n\nThere''s a real comfort here. One person may feel seen, and the other may feel needed in a way that actually feels good. It''s not always dramatic or flashy. It''s more like, \"Oh, I can relax around you.\"\n\nThe problem is that comfort can turn into dependence. One person may start expecting the other to always be their soft place to land, and the relationship can get a little too comfortable without anyone noticing.\n\nEnjoy the closeness, but don''t disappear into it. This works best when both people still have their own life."},{"heading":"Tension","body":"The problem is that comfort can turn into dependence. One person may start expecting the other to always be their soft place to land, and the relationship can get a little too comfortable without anyone noticing."},{"heading":"Advice","body":"Enjoy the closeness, but don''t disappear into it. This works best when both people still have their own life."}],"synastryKb":{"id":"A-moon_B-sun_conjunction","kind":"interaspect","plainTranslation":"The Moon person''s feelings meet the Sun person''s identity with very little translation needed. The Moon person often feels recognized at an instinctive level, while the Sun person feels emotionally received. Strong glue, but still not proof of fit; build behavior around the ease.","summaryDeep":"This can feel familiar right away. One person''s personality fits easily with the other person''s emotional needs, so being around each other may feel natural without either of you doing much.\n\nThere''s a real comfort here. One person may feel seen, and the other may feel needed in a way that actually feels good. It''s not always dramatic or flashy. It''s more like, \"Oh, I can relax around you.\"\n\nThe problem is that comfort can turn into dependence. One person may start expecting the other to always be their soft place to land, and the relationship can get a little too comfortable without anyone noticing.\n\nEnjoy the closeness, but don''t disappear into it. This works best when both people still have their own life.","tension":"The problem is that comfort can turn into dependence. One person may start expecting the other to always be their soft place to land, and the relationship can get a little too comfortable without anyone noticing.","advice":"Enjoy the closeness, but don''t disappear into it. This works best when both people still have their own life.","policy":"Governed by synastry-policy. Descriptive, not deterministic; intensity is never treated as obligation, safety concerns override astrology.","note":"Refined from approved project relationship source material. Source files were not copied into the repository.","status":"DRAFT","authoringStatus":"locked","weight":1}}'::jsonb, 'synastry_aspect', 'Seeded from authored synastry KB. summaryShort is preserved as NULL when absent or null.', now()),
  ('A-moon_B-sun_opposition', 'synastry', 'in_depth', 'LIVE', 'synastry-aspect', null::date, '{"kind":"interaspect","planetA":"moon","planetB":"sun","aspect":"opposition"}'::jsonb, ARRAY['A-moon_B-sun_opposition', 'synastry-moon-opposition-sun', 'relationship-moon-opposition-sun']::text[], '{"contentType":"synastry-kb-seed","source":"packages/astro-knowledge","sourcePath":"packages/astro-knowledge/data/synastry/aspects/A-moon_B-sun_opposition.json","collection":"synastry/aspects","kbId":"A-moon_B-sun_opposition","importedStatus":"DRAFT"}'::jsonb, 'synastry-kb-v1', null, 'Moon Opposition Sun', 'There''s a strong pull here, but you may not always feel like you''re coming from the same place. One person''s way of being can bring up a lot of feelings in the other person, sometimes in a good way, sometimes in a "why am I reacting like this?" way.', 'There''s a strong pull here, but you may not always feel like you''re coming from the same place. One person''s way of being can bring up a lot of feelings in the other person, sometimes in a good way, sometimes in a "why am I reacting like this?" way.

At its best, you balance each other out. One person brings direction, confidence, or clarity. The other brings care, sensitivity, and emotional reality. You may feel like this person has something you need, even when they also get on your nerves.

The problem is that it can turn into a standoff. One person feels unseen. The other feels like nothing they do is enough.

Don''t make it a competition over whose needs matter more. Say what you need, listen to what they need, and meet somewhere in the middle.', '{"sections":[{"heading":"Deep meaning","body":"There''s a strong pull here, but you may not always feel like you''re coming from the same place. One person''s way of being can bring up a lot of feelings in the other person, sometimes in a good way, sometimes in a \"why am I reacting like this?\" way.\n\nAt its best, you balance each other out. One person brings direction, confidence, or clarity. The other brings care, sensitivity, and emotional reality. You may feel like this person has something you need, even when they also get on your nerves.\n\nThe problem is that it can turn into a standoff. One person feels unseen. The other feels like nothing they do is enough.\n\nDon''t make it a competition over whose needs matter more. Say what you need, listen to what they need, and meet somewhere in the middle."},{"heading":"Tension","body":"The problem is that it can turn into a standoff. One person feels unseen. The other feels like nothing they do is enough."},{"heading":"Advice","body":"Don''t make it a competition over whose needs matter more. Say what you need, listen to what they need, and meet somewhere in the middle."}],"synastryKb":{"id":"A-moon_B-sun_opposition","kind":"interaspect","plainTranslation":"The Moon person and Sun person often stand on opposite sides of the same room: one leading from feeling, one from identity. The attraction can be strong because each carries what the other notices. The work is trading perspective instead of casting one person as too needy or too self-focused.","summaryDeep":"There''s a strong pull here, but you may not always feel like you''re coming from the same place. One person''s way of being can bring up a lot of feelings in the other person, sometimes in a good way, sometimes in a \"why am I reacting like this?\" way.\n\nAt its best, you balance each other out. One person brings direction, confidence, or clarity. The other brings care, sensitivity, and emotional reality. You may feel like this person has something you need, even when they also get on your nerves.\n\nThe problem is that it can turn into a standoff. One person feels unseen. The other feels like nothing they do is enough.\n\nDon''t make it a competition over whose needs matter more. Say what you need, listen to what they need, and meet somewhere in the middle.","tension":"The problem is that it can turn into a standoff. One person feels unseen. The other feels like nothing they do is enough.","advice":"Don''t make it a competition over whose needs matter more. Say what you need, listen to what they need, and meet somewhere in the middle.","policy":"Governed by synastry-policy. Descriptive, not deterministic; intensity is never treated as obligation, safety concerns override astrology.","note":"Refined from approved project relationship source material. Source files were not copied into the repository.","status":"DRAFT","authoringStatus":"locked","weight":1}}'::jsonb, 'synastry_aspect', 'Seeded from authored synastry KB. summaryShort is preserved as NULL when absent or null.', now()),
  ('A-moon_B-sun_sextile', 'synastry', 'in_depth', 'LIVE', 'synastry-aspect', null::date, '{"kind":"interaspect","planetA":"moon","planetB":"sun","aspect":"sextile"}'::jsonb, ARRAY['A-moon_B-sun_sextile', 'synastry-moon-sextile-sun', 'relationship-moon-sextile-sun']::text[], '{"contentType":"synastry-kb-seed","source":"packages/astro-knowledge","sourcePath":"packages/astro-knowledge/data/synastry/aspects/A-moon_B-sun_sextile.json","collection":"synastry/aspects","kbId":"A-moon_B-sun_sextile","importedStatus":"DRAFT"}'::jsonb, 'synastry-kb-v1', null, 'Moon Sextile Sun', 'There''s a good fit here, but it gets better when both people actually put something into it. One person''s way of being can support the other person''s emotional needs, especially when there''s effort, attention, and basic follow-through.', 'There''s a good fit here, but it gets better when both people actually put something into it. One person''s way of being can support the other person''s emotional needs, especially when there''s effort, attention, and basic follow-through.

This is the kind of connection where small things count. Checking in. Remembering what matters. Being a little more present than you technically have to be. The more you invest, the safer and warmer it feels.

The problem is leaving it half-open. The compatibility is there, but it may stay kind of mild if both people wait for the other one to make it more real.

Make the effort. Not a grand gesture, just enough to show the connection matters.', '{"sections":[{"heading":"Deep meaning","body":"There''s a good fit here, but it gets better when both people actually put something into it. One person''s way of being can support the other person''s emotional needs, especially when there''s effort, attention, and basic follow-through.\n\nThis is the kind of connection where small things count. Checking in. Remembering what matters. Being a little more present than you technically have to be. The more you invest, the safer and warmer it feels.\n\nThe problem is leaving it half-open. The compatibility is there, but it may stay kind of mild if both people wait for the other one to make it more real.\n\nMake the effort. Not a grand gesture, just enough to show the connection matters."},{"heading":"Tension","body":"The problem is leaving it half-open. The compatibility is there, but it may stay kind of mild if both people wait for the other one to make it more real."},{"heading":"Advice","body":"Make the effort. Not a grand gesture, just enough to show the connection matters."}],"synastryKb":{"id":"A-moon_B-sun_sextile","kind":"interaspect","plainTranslation":"The Moon person can support the Sun person''s direction, and the Sun person can give the Moon person a clear place to respond from. The warmth is available, but it wants small choices: checking in, noticing moods, and making room for both identity and need.","summaryDeep":"There''s a good fit here, but it gets better when both people actually put something into it. One person''s way of being can support the other person''s emotional needs, especially when there''s effort, attention, and basic follow-through.\n\nThis is the kind of connection where small things count. Checking in. Remembering what matters. Being a little more present than you technically have to be. The more you invest, the safer and warmer it feels.\n\nThe problem is leaving it half-open. The compatibility is there, but it may stay kind of mild if both people wait for the other one to make it more real.\n\nMake the effort. Not a grand gesture, just enough to show the connection matters.","tension":"The problem is leaving it half-open. The compatibility is there, but it may stay kind of mild if both people wait for the other one to make it more real.","advice":"Make the effort. Not a grand gesture, just enough to show the connection matters.","policy":"Governed by synastry-policy. Descriptive, not deterministic; intensity is never treated as obligation, safety concerns override astrology.","note":"Refined from approved project relationship source material. Source files were not copied into the repository.","status":"DRAFT","authoringStatus":"locked","weight":1}}'::jsonb, 'synastry_aspect', 'Seeded from authored synastry KB. summaryShort is preserved as NULL when absent or null.', now()),
  ('A-moon_B-sun_square', 'synastry', 'in_depth', 'LIVE', 'synastry-aspect', null::date, '{"kind":"interaspect","planetA":"moon","planetB":"sun","aspect":"square"}'::jsonb, ARRAY['A-moon_B-sun_square', 'synastry-moon-square-sun', 'relationship-moon-square-sun']::text[], '{"contentType":"synastry-kb-seed","source":"packages/astro-knowledge","sourcePath":"packages/astro-knowledge/data/synastry/aspects/A-moon_B-sun_square.json","collection":"synastry/aspects","kbId":"A-moon_B-sun_square","importedStatus":"DRAFT"}'::jsonb, 'synastry-kb-v1', null, 'Moon Square Sun', 'There''s a connection here, but it can rub the wrong way. One person''s natural style may clash with what the other person needs to feel safe, cared for, or understood.', 'There''s a connection here, but it can rub the wrong way. One person''s natural style may clash with what the other person needs to feel safe, cared for, or understood.

It can show up in ordinary little moments. One person wants to move on, the other wants to talk it through. One person needs space, the other needs reassurance. Nobody has to be doing anything terrible for it to still feel frustrating.

The problem is taking the mismatch personally. You can start thinking, "Why are they like this?" when really, the two of you may just have different settings.

Don''t let every small rub become a larger story about the relationship. Name the pattern, adjust, and stop expecting the other person to magically know what would make you feel better.', '{"sections":[{"heading":"Deep meaning","body":"There''s a connection here, but it can rub the wrong way. One person''s natural style may clash with what the other person needs to feel safe, cared for, or understood.\n\nIt can show up in ordinary little moments. One person wants to move on, the other wants to talk it through. One person needs space, the other needs reassurance. Nobody has to be doing anything terrible for it to still feel frustrating.\n\nThe problem is taking the mismatch personally. You can start thinking, \"Why are they like this?\" when really, the two of you may just have different settings.\n\nDon''t let every small rub become a larger story about the relationship. Name the pattern, adjust, and stop expecting the other person to magically know what would make you feel better."},{"heading":"Tension","body":"The problem is taking the mismatch personally. You can start thinking, \"Why are they like this?\" when really, the two of you may just have different settings."},{"heading":"Advice","body":"Don''t let every small rub become a larger story about the relationship. Name the pattern, adjust, and stop expecting the other person to magically know what would make you feel better."}],"synastryKb":{"id":"A-moon_B-sun_square","kind":"interaspect","plainTranslation":"The Moon person''s needs and the Sun person''s way of being can rub in a place both people feel quickly. One person''s normal self-expression may land as emotional disruption to the other. This can work, but only when both people stop treating their own rhythm as the only reasonable one.","summaryDeep":"There''s a connection here, but it can rub the wrong way. One person''s natural style may clash with what the other person needs to feel safe, cared for, or understood.\n\nIt can show up in ordinary little