  ('A-sun_B-saturn_square', 'synastry', 'in_depth', 'LIVE', 'synastry-aspect', null::date, '{"kind":"interaspect","planetA":"sun","planetB":"saturn","aspect":"square"}'::jsonb, ARRAY['A-sun_B-saturn_square', 'synastry-sun-square-saturn', 'relationship-sun-square-saturn']::text[], '{"contentType":"synastry-kb-seed","source":"packages/astro-knowledge","sourcePath":"packages/astro-knowledge/data/synastry/aspects/A-sun_B-saturn_square.json","collection":"synastry/aspects","kbId":"A-sun_B-saturn_square","importedStatus":"REVIEWED"}'::jsonb, 'synastry-kb-v1', null, 'Sun Square Saturn', null, 'Identity under pressure from the other''s limits or authority. One feels blocked or judged; the other feels responsible for reining them in. Failure mode: resentment dressed as respect, or control dressed as care. Push on what genuinely needs structure and drop the rest; don''t let it become one person managing the other.', '{"sections":[{"heading":"Translation","body":"Identity under pressure from the other''s limits or authority. One feels blocked or judged; the other feels responsible for reining them in. Failure mode: resentment dressed as respect, or control dressed as care. Push on what genuinely needs structure and drop the rest; don''t let it become one person managing the other."}],"synastryKb":{"id":"A-sun_B-saturn_square","kind":"interaspect","plainTranslation":"Identity under pressure from the other''s limits or authority. One feels blocked or judged; the other feels responsible for reining them in. Failure mode: resentment dressed as respect, or control dressed as care. Push on what genuinely needs structure and drop the rest; don''t let it become one person managing the other.","summaryDeep":null,"tension":null,"advice":null,"policy":"Governed by synastry-policy. Descriptive, not deterministic; intensity is never treated as obligation, safety concerns override astrology.","note":"Imported from approved project marquee synastry aspect material. Source file was not copied