  ('A-sun_B-sun_sextile', 'synastry', 'in_depth', 'LIVE', 'synastry-aspect', null::date, '{"kind":"interaspect","planetA":"sun","planetB":"sun","aspect":"sextile"}'::jsonb, ARRAY['A-sun_B-sun_sextile', 'synastry-sun-sextile-sun', 'relationship-sun-sextile-sun']::text[], '{"contentType":"synastry-kb-seed","source":"packages/astro-knowledge","sourcePath":"packages/astro-knowledge/data/synastry/aspects/A-sun_B-sun_sextile.json","collection":"synastry/aspects","kbId":"A-sun_B-sun_sextile","importedStatus":"DRAFT"}'::jsonb, 'synastry-kb-v1', null, 'Sun Sextile Sun', null, 'There is an easy understanding here, but it tends to grow through participation. You may naturally get each other, yet the connection becomes more meaningful when you stay curious about each other''s lives and take an active interest in what matters to the other person.

When this works, there is a quiet sense of being on each other''s side. You may encourage each other in small ways, remember what matters to the other person, or take an interest in things that might seem insignificant to everyone else. The support is not flashy, but it feels genuine.

The harder part is assuming that getting along is enough. You may enjoy each other''s company and still keep the relationship at arm''s length. The connection stays easy and enjoyable, but never quite grows into something deeper.', '{"sections":[{"heading":"Deep meaning","body":"There is an easy understanding here, but it tends to grow through participation. You may naturally get each other, yet the connection becomes more meaningful when you stay curious about each other''s lives and take an active interest in what matters to the other person.\n\nWhen this works, there is a quiet sense of being on each other''s side. You may encourage each other in small ways, remember what matters to the other person, or take an interest in things that might seem insignificant to everyone else. The support is not flashy, but it feels genuine.\n\nThe harder part is assuming that getting along is enough. You may enjoy each other''s company and still keep the relationship at arm''s length. The connection stays easy and enjoyable, but never quite grows into something deeper."},{"heading":"Tension","body":"The harder part is assuming that getting along is enough. You may enjoy each other''s company and still keep the relationship at arm''s length. The connection stays easy and enjoyable, but never quite grows into something deeper."}],"synastryKb":{"id":"A-sun_B-sun_sextile","kind":"interaspect","plainTranslation":"A''s identity meets B''s identity. The sextile supports them, if you act on it.","summaryDeep":"There is an easy understanding here, but it tends to grow through participation. You may naturally get each other, yet the connection becomes more meaningful when you stay curious about each other''s lives and take an active interest in what matters to the other person.\n\nWhen this works, there is a quiet sense of being on each other''s side. You may encourage each other in small ways, remember what matters to the other person, or take an interest in things that might seem insignificant to everyone else. The support is not flashy, but it feels genuine.\n\nThe harder part is assuming that getting along is enough. You may enjoy each other''s company and still keep the relationship at arm''s length. The connection stays easy and enjoyable, but never quite grows into something deeper.","tension":"The harder part is assuming that getting along is enough. You may enjoy each other''s company and still keep the relationship at arm''s length. The connection stays easy and enjoyable, but never quite grows into something deeper.","advice":null,"policy":"Governed by synastry-policy. Descriptive, not deterministic; intensity is never treated as obligation, safety concerns override astrology.","note":"Imported from project-authored synastry matrix material. Source file was not copied into the repository.","status":"DRAFT","authoringStatus":"locked","weight":2}}'::jsonb, 'synastry_aspect', 'Seeded from authored synastry KB. summaryShort is preserved as NULL when absent or null.', now()),
  ('A-sun_B-sun_square', 'synastry', 'in_depth', 'LIVE', 'synastry-aspect', null::date, '{"kind":"interaspect","planetA":"sun","planetB":"sun","aspect":"square"}'::jsonb, ARRAY['A-sun_B-sun_square', 'synastry-sun-square-sun', 'relationship-sun-square-sun']::text[], '{"contentType":"synastry-kb-seed","source":"packages/astro-knowledge","sourcePath":"packages/astro-knowledge/data/synastry/aspects/A-sun_B-sun_square.json","collection":"synastry/aspects","kbId":"A-sun_B-sun_square","importedStatus":"DRAFT"}'::jsonb, 'synastry-kb-v1', null, 'Sun Square Sun', null, 'This person can get under your skin without meaning to. It may be something small: the way they jump in with an opinion, the confidence they bring into a room, or the way they seem completely comfortable doing things their own way. Whatever it is, you may find yourself reacting more strongly than the situation seems to call for.

When this works, it can push you to be more honest with yourself. This person may have a way of exposing habits, blind spots, or assumptions you usually do not question. You may not always enjoy being challenged by them, but they can make it harder to keep doing things the same way without noticing why.

The harder part is when everything starts feeling personal. You may read their confidence as arrogance. They may read yours the same way. A normal difference in style can start to feel like disrespect, even when neither person means it that way.

Not every difference is a challenge to answer. Sometimes the other person is just being themselves, not trying to outshine you. The more you can remember that, the easier it is to stop turning friction into a competition.', '{"sections":[{"heading":"Deep meaning","body":"This person can get under your skin without meaning to. It may be something small: the way they jump in with an opinion, the confidence they bring into a room, or the way they seem completely comfortable doing things their own way. Whatever it is, you may find yourself reacting more strongly than the situation seems to call for.\n\nWhen this works, it can push you to be more honest with yourself. This person may have a way of exposing habits, blind spots, or assumptions you usually do not question. You may not always enjoy being challenged by them, but they can make it harder to keep doing things the same way without noticing why.\n\nThe harder part is when everything starts feeling personal. You may read their confidence as arrogance. They may read yours the same way. A normal difference in style can start to feel like disrespect, even when neither person means it that way.\n\nNot every difference is a challenge to answer. Sometimes the other person is just being themselves, not trying to outshine you. The more you can remember that, the easier it is to stop turning friction into a competition."},{"heading":"Tension","body":"The harder part is when everything starts feeling personal. You may read their confidence as arrogance. They may read yours the same way. A normal difference in style can start to feel like disrespect, even when neither person means it that way."},{"heading":"Advice","body":"Not every difference is a challenge to answer. Sometimes the other person is just being themselves, not trying to outshine you. The more you can remember that, the easier it is to stop turning friction into a competition."}],"synastryKb":{"id":"A-sun_B-sun_square","kind":"interaspect","plainTranslation":"A'