ght":2}}'::jsonb, 'synastry_aspect', 'Seeded from authored synastry KB. summaryShort is preserved as NULL when absent or null.', now()),
  ('A-sun_B-sun_trine', 'synastry', 'in_depth', 'LIVE', 'synastry-aspect', null::date, '{"kind":"interaspect","planetA":"sun","planetB":"sun","aspect":"trine"}'::jsonb, ARRAY['A-sun_B-sun_trine', 'synastry-sun-trine-sun', 'relationship-sun-trine-sun']::text[], '{"contentType":"synastry-kb-seed","source":"packages/astro-knowledge","sourcePath":"packages/astro-knowledge/data/synastry/aspects/A-sun_B-sun_trine.json","collection":"synastry/aspects","kbId":"A-sun_B-sun_trine","importedStatus":"DRAFT"}'::jsonb, 'synastry-kb-v1', null, 'Sun Trine Sun', null, 'Being around this person may feel easy in a way that is hard to notice at first because nothing is demanding your attention. You can relax into being yourself. You do not feel like you have to prove who you are, explain your choices, or brace for criticism. There is room to just be.

When this works, there is an easy respect between you. You may understand where the other person is coming from without needing a long explanation. It can feel natural to support each other, celebrate each other''s wins, or simply let each other be who you are.

It may not be the kind of connection that grabs your attention right away, but it can be one of the easiest to settle into. Being around each other often feels comfortable because neither person is constantly questioning, correcting, or pushing the other to be someone else.

The only real challenge is assuming the connection will take care of itself. It is easy to enjoy how comfortable things feel and never move beyond that.

Make something of the ease. Stay curious about each other, show up when it matters, and give the connection somewhere to grow. The natural fit is valuable, but it becomes stronger when you actively build on it.', '{"sections":[{"heading":"Deep meaning","body":"Being around this person may feel easy in a way that is hard to notice at first because nothing is demanding your attention. You can relax into being yourself. You do not feel like you have to prove who you are, explain your choices, or brace for criticism. There is room to just be.\n\nWhen this works, there is an easy respect between you. You may understand where the other person is coming from without needing a long explanation. It can feel natural to support each other, celebrate each other''s wins, or simply let each other be who you are.\n\nIt may not be the kind of connection that grabs your attention right away, but it can be one of the easiest to settle into. Being around each other often feels comfortable because neither person is constantly questioning, correcting, or pushing the other to be someone else.\n\nThe only real challenge is assuming the connection will take care of itself. It is easy to enjoy how comfortable things feel and never move beyond that.\n\nMake something of the ease. Stay curious about each other, show up when it matters, and give the connection somewhere to grow. The natural fit is valuable, but it becomes stronger when you actively build on it."},{"heading":"Tension","body":"The only real challenge is assuming the connection will take care of itself. It is easy to enjoy how comfortable things feel and never move beyond that."},{"heading":"Advice","body":"Make something of the ease. Stay curious about each other, show up when it matters, and give the connection somewhere to grow. The natural fit is valuable, but it becomes stronger when you actively build on it."}],"synastryKb":{"id":"A-sun_B-sun_trine","kind":"interaspect","plainTranslation":"A''s identity meets B''s identity.