  ('A-sun_B-uranus_trine', 'synastry', 'in_depth', 'LIVE', 'synastry-aspect', null::date, '{"kind":"interaspect","planetA":"sun","planetB":"uranus","aspect":"trine"}'::jsonb, ARRAY['A-sun_B-uranus_trine', 'synastry-sun-trine-uranus', 'relationship-sun-trine-uranus']::text[], '{"contentType":"synastry-kb-seed","source":"packages/astro-knowledge","sourcePath":"packages/astro-knowledge/data/synastry/aspects/A-sun_B-uranus_trine.json","collection":"synastry/aspects","kbId":"A-sun_B-uranus_trine","importedStatus":"DRAFT"}'::jsonb, 'synastry-kb-v1', null, 'Sun Trine Uranus', null, 'A''s identity meets B''s need for freedom. The trine lets them flow together easily.', '{"sections":[{"heading":"Translation","body":"A''s identity meets B''s need for freedom. The trine lets them flow together easily."}],"synastryKb":{"id":"A-sun_B-uranus_trine","kind":"interaspect","plainTranslation":"A''s identity meets B''s need for freedom. The trine lets them flow together easily.","summaryDeep":null,"tension":null,"advice":null,"policy":"Governed by synastry-policy. Descriptive, not deterministic; intensity is never treated as obligation, safety concerns override astrology.","note":"Imported from project-authored synastry matrix material. Source file was not copied into the repository.","status":"DRAFT","authoringStatus":null,"weight":null}}'::jsonb, 'synastry_aspect', 'Seeded from authored synastry KB. summaryShort is preserved as NULL when absent or null.', now()),
  ('A-sun_B-venus_conjunction', 'synastry', 'in_depth', 'LIVE', 'synastry-aspect', null::date, '{"kind":"interaspect","planetA":"sun","planetB":"venus","aspect":"conjunction"}'::jsonb, ARRAY['A-sun_B-venus_conjunction', 'synastry-sun-conjunction-venus', 'relationship-sun-conjunction-venus']::text[], '{"contentType":"synastry-kb-seed","source":"packages/astro-knowledge","sourcePath":"packages/astro-knowledge/data/synastry/aspects/A-sun_B-venus_conjunction.json","collection":"synastry/aspects","kbId":"A-sun_B-venus_conjunction","importedStatus":"REVIEWED"}'::jsonb, 'synastry-kb-v1', null, 'Sun Conjunction Venus', 'There''s an easy fondness here. One person''s way of being just feels likable to the other, almost without trying. You may enjoy each other''s company right away, and there can be a real sense of being appreciated for who you already are.', 'There''s an easy fondness here. One person''s way of being just feels likable to the other, almost without trying. You may enjoy each other''s company right away, and there can be a real sense of being appreciated for who you already are.

This tends to feel good without needing much explanation. Compliments come more naturally. Affection is easier to show. Being together may feel pleasant, warm, and simple in a way that makes both people want to come back for more. It''s the kind of connection where you actually like the person, not just want their attention.

The thing to watch is that pleasant can stay shallow. If everything stays nice and nobody ever pushes past the easy surface, the connection can stall at "we get along great" without becoming much deeper.

Let yourself enjoy it, but don''t stop at nice. Liking someone is a good start, not the whole story.', '{"sections":[{"heading":"Deep meaning","body":"There''s an easy fondness here. One person''s way of being just feels likable to the other, almost without trying. You may enjoy each other''s company right away, and there can be a real sense of being appreciated for who you already are.\n\nThis tends to feel good without needing much explanation. Compliments come more naturally. Affection is easier to show. Being together may feel pleasant, warm, and simple in a way that makes both people want to come back for more. It''s the kind of connection where you actually like the person, not just want their attention.\n\nThe thing to watch is that pleasant can stay shallow. If everything stays nice and nobody ever pushes past the easy surface, the connection can stall at \"we get along great\" without becoming much deeper.\n\nLet yourself enjoy it, but don''t stop at nice. Liking someone is a good start, not the whole story."},{"heading":"Tension","body":"The thing to watch is that pleasant can stay shallow. If everything stays nice and nobody ever pushes past the easy surface, the connection can stall at \"we get along great\" without becoming much deeper."},{"heading":"Advice","body":"Let yourself enjoy it, but don''t stop at nice. Liking someone is a good start, not the whole story."}],"synastryKb":{"id":"A-sun_B-venus_conjunction","kind":"interaspect","plainTranslation":"Warm, affectionate, naturally drawn together. The Venus person adores the Sun person; the Sun person feels appreciated and seen. One of the gentlest attraction contacts. Failure mode: pleasant but passive - lots of warmth, little drive. Enjoy the affection, and make sure something supplies the momentum.","summaryDeep":"There''s an easy fondness here. One person''s way of being just feels likable to the other, almost without trying. You may enjoy each other''s company right away, and there can be a real sense of being appreciated for who you already are.\n\nThis tends to feel good without needing much explanation. Compliments come more naturally. Affection is easier to show. Being together may feel pleasant, warm, and simple in a way that makes both people want to come back for more. It''s the kind of connection where you actually like the person, not just want their attention.\n\nThe thing to watch is that pleasant can stay shallow. If everything stays nice and nobody ever pushes past the easy surface, the connection can stall at \"we get along great\" without becoming much deeper.\n\nLet yourself enjoy it, but don''t stop at nice. Liking someone is a good start, not the whole story.","tension":"The thing to watch is that pleasant can stay shallow. If everything stays nice and nobody ever pushes past the easy surface, the connection can stall at \"we get along great\" without becoming much deeper.","advice":"Let yourself enjoy it, but don''t stop at nice. Liking someone is a good start, not the whole story.","policy":"Governed by synastry-policy. Descriptive, not deterministic; intensity is never treated as obligation, safety concerns override astrology.","note":"Imported from approved project marquee synastry aspect material. Source file was not copied into the repository.","status":"REVIEWED","authoringStatus":"locked","weight":1}}'::jsonb, 'synastry_aspect', 'Seeded from authored synastry KB. summaryShort is preserved as NULL when absent or null.', now()),
  ('A-sun_B-venus_opposition', 'synastry', 'in_depth', 'LIVE', 'synastry-aspect', null::date, '{"kind":"interaspect","planetA":"sun","planetB":"venus","aspect":"opposition"}'::jsonb, ARRAY['A-sun_B-venus_opposition', 'synastry-sun-opposition-venus', 'relationship-sun-opposition-venus']::text[], '{"contentType":"synastry-kb-seed","source":"packages/astro-knowledge","sourcePath":"packages/astro-knowledge/data/synastry/aspects/A-sun_B-venus_opposition.json","collection":"synastry/aspects","kbId":"A-sun_B-venus_opposition","importedStatus":"REVIEWED"}'::jsonb, 'synastry-kb-v1', null, 'Sun Opposition Venus', 'There''s attraction here, but you may not always like or value things in the same way. One person can find the other charming partly because they''re different, but that same difference can also make the connection feel a little uneven.', 'There''s attraction here, but you may not always like or value things in the same way. One person can find the other charming partly because they''re different, but that same difference can also make the connection feel a little uneven.

At its best, this is the pull of someone who brings a different style, mood, or way of showing affection. They may make life feel more interesting, more beautiful, or just less like your usual routine. At its worst, you keep running into the gap between what one person means as love and what the other person actually receives.

The problem is expecting appreciation to look the same on both sides. The attraction may be real, but you may not always agree on what feels thoughtful, romantic, or worth caring about.

Appreciate the difference without making it a test. Find what you both enjoy, instead of trying to win the argument about taste.', '{"sections":[{"heading":"Deep meaning","body":"There''s attraction here, but you may not always like or value things in the same way. One person can find the other charming partly because they''re different, but that same difference can also make the connection feel a little uneven.\n\nAt its best, this is the pull of someone who brings a different style, mood, or way of showing affection. They may make life feel more interesting, more beautiful, or just less like your usual routine. At its worst, you keep running into the gap between what one person means as love and what the other person actually receives.\n\nThe problem is expecting appreciation to look the same on both sides. The attraction may be real, but you may not always agree on what feels thoughtful, romantic, or worth caring about.\n\nAppreciate the difference without making it a test. Find what you both enjoy, instead of trying to win the argument about taste."},{"heading":"Tension","body":"The problem is expecting appreciation to look the same on both sides. The attraction may be real, but you may not always agree on what feels thoughtful, romantic, or worth caring about."},{"heading":"Advice","body":"Appreciate the difference without making it a test. Find what you both enjoy, instead of trying to win the argument about taste."}],"synastryKb":{"id":"A-sun_B-venus_opposition","kind":"interaspect","plainTranslation":"Mutual attraction across a difference in style or taste. You''re drawn together but value different things. Failure mode: low-grade friction over aesthetics or priorities. Let the contrast add color instead of arguing over it.","summaryDeep":"There''s attraction here, but you may not always like or value things in the same way. One person can find the other charming partly because they''re different, but that same difference can also make the connection feel a 