  ('A-sun_B-venus_sextile', 'synastry', 'in_depth', 'LIVE', 'synastry-aspect', null::date, '{"kind":"interaspect","planetA":"sun","planetB":"venus","aspect":"sextile"}'::jsonb, ARRAY['A-sun_B-venus_sextile', 'synastry-sun-sextile-venus', 'relationship-sun-sextile-venus']::text[], '{"contentType":"synastry-kb-seed","source":"packages/astro-knowledge","sourcePath":"packages/astro-knowledge/data/synastry/aspects/A-sun_B-venus_sextile.json","collection":"synastry/aspects","kbId":"A-sun_B-venus_sextile","importedStatus":"REVIEWED"}'::jsonb, 'synastry-kb-v1', null, 'Sun Sextile Venus', 'There''s a warm, likable fit here, and it gets better when both people put something into it. One person''s way of being and the other person''s affection support each other well, but the warmth tends to open more when you actually lean into it.', 'There''s a warm, likable fit here, and it gets better when both people put something into it. One person''s way of being and the other person''s affection support each other well, but the warmth tends to open more when you actually lean into it.

This often shows up as a connection that gets nicer the more you engage. A little appreciation goes a long way. Small kindnesses are noticed. The fondness is available, but it becomes stronger when someone bothers to show it.

Where it falls flat is leaving the good feeling unspoken. Both people may assume the other knows they''re appreciated, and then the connection stays quieter than it needs to be.

Say the nice thing out loud. This one grows every time someone bothers to express it.', '{"sections":[{"heading":"Deep meaning","body":"There''s a warm, likable fit here, and it gets better when both people put something into it. One person''s way of being and the other person''s affection support each other well, but the warmth tends to open more when you actually lean into it.\n\nThis often shows up as a connection that gets nicer the more you engage. A little appreciation goes a long way. Small kindnesses are noticed. The fondness is available, but it becomes stronger when someone bothers to show it.\n\nWhere it falls flat is leaving the good feeling unspoken. Both people may assume the other knows they''re appreciated, and then the connection stays quieter than it needs to be.\n\nSay the nice thing out loud. This one grows every time someone bothers to express it."},{"heading":"Tension","body":"Where it falls flat is leaving the good feeling unspoken. Both people may assume the other knows they''re appreciated, and then the connection stays quieter than it needs to be."},{"heading":"Advice","body":"Say the nice thing out loud. This one grows every time someone bothers to express it."}],"synastryKb":{"id":"A-sun_B-venus_sextile","kind":"interaspect","plainTranslation":"Easy warmth and mutual appreciation, with room to act on it. You like each other and it shows. Failure mode: coasting on the niceness. Take the opening and let it grow.","summaryDeep":"There''s a warm, likable fit here, and it gets better when both people put something into it. One person''s way of being and the other person''s affection support each other well, but the warmth tends to open more when you actually lean into it.\n\nThis often shows up as a connection that gets nicer the more you engage. A little appreciation goes a long way. Small kindnesses are noticed. The fondness is available, but it becomes stronger when someone bothers to show it.\n\nWhere it falls flat is leaving the good feeling unspoken. Both people may assume the other knows they''re appreciated, and then the connection stays quieter than it needs to be.\n\nSay the nice thing out loud. This one grows every time someone bothers to express it.","tension":"Where it falls flat is leaving the good feeling unspoken. Both people may assume the other knows they''re appreciated, and then the connection stays quieter than it needs to be.","advice":"Say the nice thing out loud. This one grows every time someone bothers to express it.","policy":"Governed by synastry-policy. Descriptive, not deterministic; intensity is never treated as obligation, safety concerns override astrology.","note":"Imported from approved project marquee synastry aspect material. Source file was not copied into the repository.","status":"REVIEWED","authoringStatus":"locked","weight":1}}'::jsonb, 'synastry_aspect', 'Seeded from authored synastry KB. summaryShort is preserved as NULL when absent or null.', now()),
  ('A-sun_B-venus_square', 'synastry', 'in_depth', 'LIVE', 'synastry-aspect', null::date, '{"kind":"interaspect","planetA":"sun","planetB":"venus","aspect":"square"}'::jsonb, ARRAY['A-sun_B-venus_square', 'synastry-sun-square-venus', 'relationship-sun-square-venus']::text[], '{"contentType":"synastry-kb-seed","source":"packages/astro-knowledge","sourcePath":"packages/astro-knowledge/data/synastry/aspects/A-sun_B-venus_square.json","collection":"synastry/aspects","kbId":"A-sun_B-venus_square","importedStatus":"REVIEWED"}'::jsonb, 'synastry-kb-v1', null, 'Sun Square Venus', 'There''s attraction here, but it can come with a little friction around affection, taste, or feeling appreciated. One person''s natural style may not quite match how the other person likes to give or receive warmth, so the fondness is real but slightly out of step.', 'There''s attraction here, but it can come with a little friction around affection, taste, or feeling appreciated. One person''s natural style may not quite match how the other person likes to give or receive warmth, so the fondness is real but slightly out of step.

It often shows up in small ways. One person shows they care in a way the other doesn''t fully register. Compliments land oddly. Gestures get misread. Nobody''s being cold; the affection just keeps arriving in the wrong key.

The trap is reading the mismatch as a lack of caring. The feeling may be there, but the delivery keeps getting crossed.

