  ('A-venus_B-saturn_conjunction', 'synastry', 'in_depth', 'LIVE', 'synastry-aspect', null::date, '{"kind":"interaspect","planetA":"venus","planetB":"saturn","aspect":"conjunction"}'::jsonb, ARRAY['A-venus_B-saturn_conjunction', 'synastry-venus-conjunction-saturn', 'relationship-venus-conjunction-saturn']::text[], '{"contentType":"synastry-kb-seed","source":"packages/astro-knowledge","sourcePath":"packages/astro-knowledge/data/synastry/aspects/A-venus_B-saturn_conjunction.json","collection":"synastry/aspects","kbId":"A-venus_B-saturn_conjunction","importedStatus":"REVIEWED"}'::jsonb, 'synastry-kb-v1', null, 'Venus Conjunction Saturn', null, 'Love that''s serious, loyal, and built to last - and can run short on warmth. The Saturn person commits and stabilizes; the Venus person may feel loved but not adored, or kept at a measured distance. Failure mode: confusing endurance with affection, or letting love feel like an obligation. Show affection actively and don''t ration it; durable and warm are different things, and you want both.', '{"sections":[{"heading":"Translation","body":"Love that''s serious, loyal, and built to last - and can run short on warmth. The Saturn person commits and stabilizes; the Venus person may feel loved but not adored, or kept at a measured distance. Failure mode: confusing endurance with affection, or letting love feel like an obligation. Show affection actively and don''t ration it; durable and warm are different things, and you want both."}],"synastryKb":{"id":"A-venus_B-saturn_conjunction","kind":"interaspect","plainTranslation":"Love that''s serious, loyal, and built to last - and can run short on warmth. The Saturn person commits and stabilizes; the Venus person may feel loved but not adored, or kept at a measured distance. Failure mode: confusing endurance with affection, or letting love feel like an obligation. Show affection actively and don''t ration it; durable and warm are different things, and you want both.","summaryDeep":null,"tension":null,"advice":null,"policy":"Governed by synastry-policy. Descriptive, not deterministic; intensity is never treated as obligation, safety concerns override astrology.","note":"Imported from approved project marquee synastry aspect material. Source file was not copied into the repository.","status":"REVIEWED","authoringStatus":null,"weight":null}}'::jsonb, 'synastry_aspect', 'Seeded from authored synastry KB. summaryShort is preserved as NULL when absent or null.', now()),
  ('A-venus_B-saturn_opposition', 'synastry', 'in_depth', 'LIVE', 'synastry-aspect', null::date, '{"kind":"interaspect","planetA":"venus","planetB":"saturn","aspect":"opposition"}'::jsonb, ARRAY['A-venus_B-saturn_opposition', 'synastry-venus-opposition-saturn', 'relationship-venus-opposition-saturn']::text[], '{"contentType":"synastry-kb-seed","source":"packages/astro-knowledge","sourcePath":"packages/astro-knowledge/data/synastry/aspects/A-venus_B-saturn_opposition.json","collection":"synastry/aspects","kbId":"A-venus_B-saturn_opposition","importedStatus":"REVIEWED"}'::jsonb, 'synastry-kb-v1', null, 'Venus Opposition Saturn', null, 'Affection and restriction face off, often through real-world limits: money, distance, timing, or one person''s fear of committing. Failure mode: one chases warmth while the other enforces caution, and both feel starved. Decide together what''s worth committing to, and don''t let one person carry all the longing.', '{"sections":[{"heading":"Translation","body":"Affection and restriction face off, often through real-world limits: money, distance, timing, or one person''s fear of committing. Failure mode: one chases warmth while the other enforces caution, and both feel starved. Decide together what''s worth committing to, and don''t let one person carry all the longing."}],"synastryKb":{"id":"A-venus_B-saturn_opposition","kind":"interaspect","plainTranslation":"Affection and restriction face off, often through real-world limits: money, distance, timing, or one person''s fear of committing. Failure mode: one chases warmth while the other enforces caution, and both feel starved. Decide together what''s worth committing to, and don''t let one person carry all the longing.","summaryDeep":null,"tension":null,"advice":null,"policy":"Governed by synastry-policy. Descriptive, not deterministic; intensity is never treated as obligation, safety concerns override astrology.","note":"Imported from approved project marquee synastry aspect material. Source file was not copied into the repository.","status":"REVIEWED","authoringStatus":null,"weight":null}}'::jsonb, 'synastry_aspect', 'Seeded from authored synastry KB. summaryShort is preserved as NULL when absent or null.', now()),
  ('A-venus_B-saturn_sextile', 'synastry', 'in_depth', 'LIVE', 'synastry-aspect', null::date, '{"kind":"interaspect","planetA":"venus","planetB":"saturn","aspect":"sextile"}'::jsonb, ARRAY['A-venus_B-saturn_sextile', 'synastry-venus-sextile-saturn', 'relationship-venus-sextile-saturn']::text[], '{"contentType":"synastry-kb-seed","source":"packages/astro-knowledge","sourcePath":"packages/astro-knowledge/data/synastry/aspects/A-venus_B-saturn_sextile.json","collection":"synastry/aspects","kbId":"A-venus_B-saturn_sextile","importedStatus":"REVIEWED"}'::jsonb, 'synastry-kb-v1', null, 'Venus Sextile Saturn', null, 'A steadying, supportive contact for love and money. Commitment comes without much resistance and the relationship feels grounded. Failure mode: not formalizing what''s quietly solid. Make the steady choice - this aspect rewards building.', '{"sections":[{"heading":"Translation","body":"A steadying, supportive contact for love and money. Commitment comes without much resistance and the relationship feels grounded. Failure mode: not formalizing what''s quietly solid. Make the steady choice - this aspect rewards building."}],"synastryKb":{"id":"A-venus_B-saturn_sextile","kind":"interaspect","plainTranslation":"A steadying, supportive contact for love and money. Commitment comes without much resistance and the relationship feels grounded. Failure mode: not formalizing what''s quietly solid. Make the steady choice - this aspect rewards building.","summaryDeep":null,"tension":null,"advice":null,"policy":"Governed by synastry-policy. Descriptive, not deterministic; intensity is never treated as obligation, safety concerns override astrology.","note":"Imported from approved project marquee synastry aspect material. Source file was not copied into the repository.","status":"REVIEWED","authoringStatus":null,"weight":null}}'::jsonb, 'synastry_aspect', 'Seeded from authored synastry KB. summaryShort is preserved as NULL when absent or null.', now()),
  ('A-venus_B-saturn_square', 'synastry', 'in_depth', 'LIVE', 'synastry-aspect', null::date, '{"kind":"interaspect","planetA":"venus","planetB":"saturn","aspect":"square"}'::jsonb, ARRAY['A-venus_B-saturn_square', 'synastry-venus-square-saturn', 'relationship-venus-square-saturn']::text[], '{"contentType":"synastry-kb-seed","source":"packages/astro-knowledge","sourcePath":"packages/astro-knowledge/data/synastry/aspects/A-venus_B-saturn_square.json","collection":"synastry/aspects","kbId":"A-venus_B-saturn_square","importedStatus":"REVIEWED"}'::jsonb, 'synastry-kb-v1', null, 'Venus Square Saturn', null, 'Love pressed against limitation. Distance, scarcity, duty, or a reality check - affection that keeps hitting a wall. Failure mode: staying for the structure while the warmth dies, and calling the coldness maturity. Address the chill honestly; commitment without affection is a contract, not a relationship.', '{"sections":[{"heading":"Translation","body":"Love pressed against limitation. Distance, scarcity, duty, or a reality check - affection that keeps hitting a wall. Failure mode: staying for the structure while the warmth dies, and calling the coldness maturity. Address the chill honestly; commitment without affection is a contract, not a relationship."}],"synastryKb":{"id":"A-venus_B-saturn_square","kind":"interaspect","plainTranslation":"Love pressed against limitation. Distance, scarcity, duty, or a reality check - affection that keeps hitting a wall. Failure mode: staying for the structure while the warmth dies, and calling the coldness maturity. Address the chill honestly; commitment without affection is a contract, not a relationship.","summaryDeep":null,"tension":null,"advice":null,"policy":"Governed by synastry-policy. Descriptive, not deterministic; intensity is never treated as obligation, safety concerns override astrology.","note":"Imported from approved project marquee synastry aspect material. Source file was not copied into the repository.","status":"