  ('A-venus_B-saturn_trine', 'synastry', 'in_depth', 'LIVE', 'synastry-aspect', null::date, '{"kind":"interaspect","planetA":"venus","planetB":"saturn","aspect":"trine"}'::jsonb, ARRAY['A-venus_B-saturn_trine', 'synastry-venus-trine-saturn', 'relationship-venus-trine-saturn']::text[], '{"contentType":"synastry-kb-seed","source":"packages/astro-knowledge","sourcePath":"packages/astro-knowledge/data/synastry/aspects/A-venus_B-saturn_trine.json","collection":"synastry/aspects","kbId":"A-venus_B-saturn_trine","importedStatus":"REVIEWED"}'::jsonb, 'synastry-kb-v1', null, 'Venus Trine Saturn', null, 'Loyalty and stability flow naturally. Good for commitment, shared finances, and the long haul. Failure mode: the warmth stays understated. Lock in the security and keep affection visible so stable doesn''t read as distant.', '{"sections":[{"heading":"Translation","body":"Loyalty and stability flow naturally. Good for commitment, shared finances, and the long haul. Failure mode: the warmth stays understated. Lock in the security and keep affection visible so stable doesn''t read as distant."}],"synastryKb":{"id":"A-venus_B-saturn_trine","kind":"interaspect","plainTranslation":"Loyalty and stability flow naturally. Good for commitment, shared finances, and the long haul. Failure mode: the warmth stays understated. Lock in the security and keep affection visible so stable doesn''t read as distant.","summaryDeep":null,"tension":null,"advice":null,"policy":"Governed by synastry-policy. Descriptive, not deterministic; intensity is never treated as obligation, safety concerns override astrology.","note":"Imported from approved project marquee synastry aspect material. Source file was not copied into the repository.","status":"REVIEWED","authoringStatus":null,"weight":null}}'::jsonb, 'synastry_aspect', 'Seeded from authored synastry KB. summaryShort is preserved as NULL when absent or null.', now()),
  ('A-venus_B-sun_conjunction', 'synastry', 'in_depth', 'LIVE', 'synastry-aspect', null::date, '{"kind":"interaspect","planetA":"venus","planetB":"sun","aspect":"conjunction"}'::jsonb, ARRAY['A-venus_B-sun_conjunction', 'synastry-venus-conjunction-sun', 'relationship-venus-conjunction-sun']::text[], '{"contentType":"synastry-kb-seed","source":"packages/astro-knowledge","sourcePath":"packages/astro-knowledge/data/synastry/aspects/A-venus_B-sun_conjunction.json","collection":"synastry/aspects","kbId":"A-venus_B-sun_conjunction","importedStatus":"DRAFT"}'::jsonb, 'synastry-kb-v1', null, 'Venus Conjunction Sun', 'There''s an easy fondness here. One person''s way of being just feels likable to the other, almost without trying. You may enjoy each other''s company right away, and there can be a real sense of being appreciated for who you already are.', 'There''s an easy fondness here. One person''s way of being just feels likable to the other, almost without trying. You may enjoy each other''s company right away, and there can be a real sense of being appreciated for who you already are.

This tends to feel good without needing much explanation. Compliments come more naturally. Affection is easier to show. Being together may feel pleasant, warm, and simple in a way that makes both people want to come back for more. It''s the kind of connection where you actually like the person, not just want their attention.

The thing to watch is that pleasant can stay shallow. If everything stays nice and nobody ever pushes past the easy surface, the connection can stall at "we get along great" without becoming much deeper.

Let yourself enjoy it, but don''t stop at nice. Liking someone is a good start, not the whole story.', '{"sections":[{"heading":"Deep meaning","body":"There''s an easy fondness here. One person''s way of being just feels likable to the other, almost without trying. You may enjoy each other''s company right away, and there can be a real sense of being appreciated for who you already are.\n\nThis tends to feel good without needing much explanation. Compliments come more naturally. Affection is easier to show. Being together may feel pleasant, warm, and simple in a way that makes both people want to come back for more. It''s the kind of connection where you actually like the person, not just want their attention.\n\nThe thing to watch is that pleasant can stay shallow. If everything stays nice and nobody ever pushes past the easy surface, the connection can stall at \"we get along great\" without becoming much deeper.\n\nLet yourself enjoy it, but don''t stop at nice. Liking someone is a good start, not the whole story."},{"heading":"Tension","body":"The thing to watch is that pleasant can stay shallow. If everything stays nice and nobody ever pushes past the easy surface, the connection can stall at \"we get along great\" without becoming much deeper."},{"heading":"Advice","body":"Let yourself enjoy it, but don''t stop at nice. Liking someone is a good start, not the whole story."}],"synastryKb":{"id":"A-venus_B-sun_conjunction","kind":"interaspect","plainTranslation":"A''s love and values meets B''s identity. The conjunction fuses them - intense and inseparable.","summaryDeep":"There''s an easy fondness here. One person''s way of being just feels likable to the other, almost without trying. You may enjoy each other''s company right away, and there can be a real sense of being appreciated for who you already are.\n\nThis tends to feel good without needing much explanation. Compliments come more naturally. Affection is easier to show. Being together may feel pleasant, 