  ('A-venus_B-sun_opposition', 'synastry', 'in_depth', 'LIVE', 'synastry-aspect', null::date, '{"kind":"interaspect","planetA":"venus","planetB":"sun","aspect":"opposition"}'::jsonb, ARRAY['A-venus_B-sun_opposition', 'synastry-venus-opposition-sun', 'relationship-venus-opposition-sun']::text[], '{"contentType":"synastry-kb-seed","source":"packages/astro-knowledge","sourcePath":"packages/astro-knowledge/data/synastry/aspects/A-venus_B-sun_opposition.json","collection":"synastry/aspects","kbId":"A-venus_B-sun_opposition","importedStatus":"DRAFT"}'::jsonb, 'synastry-kb-v1', null, 'Venus Opposition Sun', 'There''s attraction here, but you may not always like or value things in the same way. One person can find the other charming partly because they''re different, but that same difference can also make the connection feel a little uneven.', 'There''s attraction here, but you may not always like or value things in the same way. One person can find the other charming partly because they''re different, but that same difference can also make the connection feel a little uneven.

At its best, this is the pull of someone who brings a different style, mood, or way of showing affection. They may make life feel more interesting, more beautiful, or just less like your usual routine. At its worst, you keep running into the gap between what one person means as love and what the other person actually receives.

The problem is expecting appreciation to look the same on both sides. The attraction may be real, but you may not always agree on what feels thoughtful, romantic, or worth caring about.

Appreciate the difference without making it a test. Find what you both enjoy, instead of trying to win the argument about taste.', '{"sections":[{"heading":"Deep meaning","body":"There''s attraction here, but you may not always like or value things in the same way. One person can find the other charming partly because they''re different, but that same difference can also make the connection feel a little uneven.\n\nAt its best, this is the pull of someone who brings a different style, mood, or way of showing affection. They may make life feel more interesting, more beautiful, or just less like your usual routine. At its worst, you keep running into the gap between what one person means as love and what the other person actually receives.\n\nThe problem is expecting appreciation to look the same on both sides. The attraction may be real, but you may not always agree on what feels thoughtful, romantic, or worth caring about.\n\nAppreciate the difference without making it a test. Find what you both enjoy, instead of trying to win the argument about taste."},{"heading":"Tension","body":"The problem is expecting appreciation to look the same on both sides. The attraction may be real, but you may not always agree on what feels thoughtful, romantic, or worth caring about."},{"heading":"Advice","body":"Appreciate the difference without making it a test. Find what you both enjoy, instead of trying to win the argument about taste."}],"synastryKb":{"id":"A-venus_B-sun_opposition","kind":"interaspect","plainTranslation":"A''s love and values meets B''s identity. The opposition pulls them into push-and-pull.","summaryDeep":"There''s attraction here, but you may not always like or value things in the same way. One person can find the other charming partly because they''re different, but that same difference can also make the connection feel a little uneven.\n\nAt its best, this is the pull of someone who brings a different style, mood, or way of showing affection. They may make life feel more interesting, more beautiful, or just less like your usual routine. At its worst, you keep running into the gap between what one person means as love and what the other person actually receives.\n\nThe problem is expecting appreciation to look the same on both sides. The attraction may be real, but you may not always agree on what feels thoughtful, romantic, or worth caring about.\n\nAppreciate the difference without making it a test. Find what you both enjoy, instead of trying to win the argument about taste.","tension":"The problem is expecting appreciation to look the same on both sides. The attraction may be real, but you may not always agree on what feels thoughtful, romantic, or worth caring about.","advice":"Appreciate the difference without making it a test. Find what you both enjoy, instead of trying to win the argument about taste.","policy":"Governed by synastry-policy. Descriptive, not deterministic; intensity is never treated as obligation, safety concerns override astrology.","note":"Imported from project-authored synastry matrix material. Source file was not copied into the repository.","status":"DRAFT","authoringStatus":"locked","weight":1}}'::jsonb, 'synastry_aspect', 'Seeded from authored synastry KB. summaryShort is preserved as NULL when absent or null.', now()),
  ('A-venus_B-sun_sextile', 'synastry', 'in_depth', 'LIVE', 'synastry-aspect', null::date, '{"kind":"interaspect","planetA":"venus","planetB":"sun","aspect":"sextile"}'::jsonb, ARRAY['A-venus_B-sun_sextile', 'synastry-venus-sextile-sun', 'relationship-venus-sextile-sun']::text[], '{"contentType":"synastry-kb-seed","source":"packages/astro-knowledge","sourcePath":"packages/astro-knowledge/data/synastry/aspects/A-venus_B-sun_sextile.json","collection":"synastry/aspects","kbId":"A-venus_B-sun_sextile","importedStatus":"DRAFT"}'::jsonb, 'synastry-kb-v1', null, 'Venus Sextile Sun', 'There''s a warm, likable fit here, and it gets better when both people put something into it. One person''s way of being and the other person''s affection support each other well, but the warmth tends to open more when you actually lean into it.', 'There''s a warm, likable fit here, and it gets better when both people put something into it. One person''s way of being and the other person''s affection support each other well, but the warmth tends to open more when you actually lean into it.

This often shows up as a connection that gets nicer the more you engage. A little appreciation goes a long way. Small kindnesses are noticed. The fondness is available, but it becomes stronger when someone bothers to show it.

Where it falls flat is leaving the good feeling unspoken. Both people may assume the other knows they''re appreciated, and then the connection stays quieter than it needs to be.

Say the nice thing out loud. This one grows every time someone bothers to express it.', '{"sections":[{"heading":"Deep meaning","body":"There''s a warm, likable fit here, and it gets better when both people put something into it. One person''s way of being and the other person''s affection support each other well, but the warmth tends to open more when you actually lean into it.\n\nThis often shows up as a connection that gets nicer the more you engage. A little appreciation goes a long way. Small kindnesses are noticed. The fondness is available, but it becomes stronger when someone bothers to show it.\n\nWhere it falls flat is leaving the good feeling unspoken. Both people may assume the other knows they''re appreciated, and then the connection stays quieter than it needs to be.\n\nSay the nice thing out loud. This one grows every time someone bothers to express it."},{"heading":"Tension","body":"Where it falls flat is leaving the good feeling unspoken. Both people may assume the other knows they''re appreciated, and then the connection stays quieter than it needs to be."},{"heading":"Advice","body":"Say the nice thing out loud. This one grows every time someone bothers to express it."}],"synastryKb":{"id":"A-venus_B-sun_sextile","kind":"interaspect","plainTranslation":"A''s love and values meets B''s identity. The sextile supports them, if you act on it.","summaryDeep":"There''s a warm, likable fit here, and it gets better when both people put something into it. One person''s way of being and the other person''s affection support each other well, but the warmth tends to open more when you actually lean into it.\n\nThis often shows up as a connection that gets nicer the more you engage. A little appreciation goes a long way. Small kindnesses are noticed. The fondness is available, but it becomes stronger when someone bothers to show it.\n\nWhere it falls flat is leaving the good feeling unspoken. Both people may assume the other knows they''re appreciated, and then the connection stays quieter than it needs to be.\n\nSay the nice thing out loud. This one grows every time someone bothers to express it.","tension":"Where it falls flat is leaving the good feeling unspoken. Both people may assume the other knows they''re appreciated, and then the connection stays quieter than it needs to be.","advice":"Say the nice thing out loud. This one grows every time someone bothers to express it.","policy":"Governed by synastry-policy. Descriptive, not deterministic; intensity is never treated as obligation, safety concerns override astrology.","note":"Imported from project-authored synastry matrix material. Source file was not copied into the repository.","status":"DRAFT","authoringStatus":"locked","weight":1}}'::jsonb, 'synastry_aspect', 'Seeded from authored synastry KB. summaryShort is preserved as NULL when absent or null.', now()),
  ('A-venus_B-sun_square', 'synastry', 'in_depth', 'LIVE', 'synastry-aspect', null::date, '{"kind":"interaspect","planetA":"venus","planetB":"sun","aspect":"square"}'::jsonb, ARRAY['A-venus_B-sun_square', 'synastry-venus-square-sun', 'relationship-venus-square-sun']::text[], '{"contentType":"synastry-kb-seed","source":"packages/astro-knowledge","sourcePath":"packages/astro-knowledge/data/synastry/aspects/A-venus_B-sun_square.json","collection":"synastry/aspects","kbId":"A-venus_B-sun_square","importedStatus":"DRAFT"}'::jsonb, 'synastry-kb-v1', null, 'Venus Square Sun', 'There''s attraction here, but it can come with a little friction around affection, taste, or feeling appreciated. One person''s natural style may not quite match how the other person likes to give or receive warmth, so the fondness is real but slightly out of step.', 'There''s attraction here, but it can come with a little friction around affection, taste, or feeling appreciated. One person''s natural style may not quite match how the other person likes to give or receive warmth, so the fondness is real but slightly out of step.

It often shows up in small ways. One person shows they care in a way the other doesn''t fully register. Compliments land oddly. Gestures get misread. Nobody''s being cold; the affection just keeps arriving in the wrong key.

The trap is reading the mismatch as a lack of caring. The feeling may be there, but the delivery keeps getting crossed.

Say what actually makes you feel appreciated instead of waiting to receive it the way you''d give it. This one smooths out when both people stop expecting love to arrive in their exact language.', '{"sections":[{"heading":"Deep meaning","body":"There''s attraction here, but it can come with a little friction around affection, taste, or feeling appreciated. One person''s natural style may not quite match how the other person likes to give or receive warmth, so the fondness is real but slightly out of step.\n\nIt often shows up in small ways. One person shows they care in a way the other doesn''t fully register. Compliments land oddly. Gestures get misread. Nobody''s being cold; the affection just keeps arriving in the wrong key.\n\nThe trap is reading the mismatch as a lack of caring. The feeling may be there, but the delivery keeps getting crossed.\n\nSay what actually makes you feel appreciated instead of waiting to receive it the way you''d give it. This one smooths out when both people stop expecting love to arrive in their exact language."},{"heading":"Tension","body":"The trap is reading the mismatch as a lack of caring. The feeling may be there, but the delivery keeps getting crossed."},{"heading":"Advice","body":"Say what actually makes you feel appreciated instead of waiting to receive it the way you''d give it. This one smooths out when both people stop expecting love to arrive in their exact language."}],"synastryKb":{"id":"A-venus_B-sun_square","kind":"interaspect","plainTranslation":"A''s love and values meets B''s identity. The square puts them in friction.","summaryDeep":"There''s attraction here, but it can come with a little friction around affection, taste, or feeling appreciated. One person''s natural style may not quite match how the other person likes to give or receive warmth, so the fondness is real but slightly out of step.\n\nIt often shows up in small ways. One person shows they care in a way the other doesn''t fully register. Compliments land oddly. Gestures get misread. Nobody''s being cold; the affection just keeps arriving in the wrong key.\n\nThe trap is reading the mismatch as a lack of caring. The feeling may be there, but the delivery keeps getting crossed.\n\nSay what actually makes you feel appreciated instead of waiting to receive it the way you''d give it. This one smooths out when both people stop expecting love to arrive in their exact language.","tension":"The trap is reading the mismatch as a lack of caring. The feeling may be there, but the delivery keeps getting crossed.","advice":"Say what actually makes you feel appreciated instead of waiting to receive it the way you''d give it. This one smooths out when both people stop expecting love to arrive in their exact language.","policy":"Governed by synastry-policy. Descriptive, not deterministic; intensity is never treated as obligation, safety concerns override astrology.","note":"Imported from project-authored synastry matrix material. Source file was not copied into the repository.","status":"DRAFT","authoringStatus":"locked","weight":1}}'::jsonb, 'synastry_aspect', 'Seeded from authored synastry KB. summaryShort is preserved as NULL when absent or null.', now()),
  ('A-venus_B-sun_trine', 'synastry', 'in_depth', 'LIVE', 'synastry-aspect', null::date, '{"kind":"interaspect","planetA":"venus","planetB":"sun","aspect":"trine"}'::jsonb, ARRAY['A-venus_B-sun_trine', 'synastry-venus-trine-sun', 'relationship-venus-trine-sun']::text[], '{"contentType":"synastry-kb-seed","source":"packages/astro-knowledge","sourcePath":"packages/astro-knowledge/data/synastry/aspects/A-venus_B-sun_trine.json","collection":"synastry/aspects","kbId":"A-venus_B-sun_trine","importedStatus":"DRAFT"}'::jsonb, 'synastry-kb-v1', null, 'Venus Trine Sun', 'This is a naturally warm, easy kind of connection. One person''s way of being sits well with the other person''s sense of what is lovable, so affection tends to flow without much effort.', 'This is a naturally warm, easy kind of connection. One person''s way of being sits well with the other person''s sense of what is lovable, so affection tends to flow without much effort.

There''s an unforced charm here. You enjoy each other, you appreciate each other, and there usually isn''t much drama around feeling valued. It''s the kind of ease that makes a relationship comfortable to be in and easy to stay close to.

The risk is the usual one with easy contacts: because the warmth comes naturally, neither person may think to deepen it or take care of it. A connection this pleasant can drift on autopilot.

